<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">2 SIAPHARAN</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Kings</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 SIAPHARAN</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Si</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 SIAPHARAN</para>
  <para style="mt2">2 Kings</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Siapharan Uk Ningnaw</char> nynh Israel peenaw ccangning hae phungpaw kha po a pia. E ccauh hynh phuin ning lang phia kho athua:</para>
  <para style="ip">1. BC 850 kyate Samaria ronaw cia, te thahlang peenaw athangnaw BC 722 cia peenaw ccangning hae phungpaw.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Israel peenaw aronaw kyate Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh BC 586 kya Jerusalem khua a ronaw cia Judah peenaw phungpaw. E ccauh hynh Babilon nynh Gedaliah kha Judah ram mangki lang nung zah, Babilon ram e thong kyate Judah siapharan Jehoiakhin a pounaw khate athang.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hynhcite mih minphuin kya ronaw a umpaw hynh Israel hae te Judah hae te mih siapharan hae nynh Pachia tungvaw mih lungzi khyh keiccu nynh thua. Jerusalem ronaw te Judah hae patae kha kyngte ramccang lang a cciakhae hae paw hynh Israel phungpaw kya myarya abyapipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Siapharan Uk Ningnaw</char> kyaze a minthaanpaw profeh tuh Elijah he a zuipaw Elisha kha nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Phia athuapaw peenaw 1.1—17.41</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Profeh Elisha 1.1—8.15</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Judah te Israel siapharan hae 8.16—17.4</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Samaria ronaw 17.5-41</para>
  <para style="io1">Judah peenaw 18.1—25.30</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Hezekiah kyate Josiah kyacia 18.1—21.26</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Josiah uknaw 22.1—23.30</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Nyathyakou Judah siapharan hae 23.31—24.20</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Jerusalem ronaw 25.1-30</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Elijah te Ahaziah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahab a chih koute Moab nynh Israel kha a dou.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaziah tuh Samaria khua kya a inn palung khaan thanlan-aw kyate ccah zah maw a mue; tukeiccuze locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, “Ekron khua e pachia Baal-zebub kalan la cceih oh lah, e vaemaw kyate ka danthui cih tou, ka danthui lan khyh tou cipaw kha la khia oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Tishbe khuapaw Elijah kha, “Thokuh lah, Samaria siapharan a locceihtu hae te tungku khylan la cceih lah, minmin kha, ‘Israel ram kya Pachia a um khyh keiccu tou, Ekron khua pachia Baal-zebub kalan byakhia khylan nae ccia oh?’ cite la hopah hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, ‘Na kaenaw ikhung kyate na rung vae lan khyh, na chih ccaccing cih,’ a ci cite la ho,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Elijah tuh a cceih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Locceihtu hae tuh siapharan kalan ki hae zah, aning nynh minmin kha, “Pawccemou nae ki oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Kaening te tungku khylan ccungccapaw lu kheit yn cceih zah, aning nynh kaening kha, ‘Nanning ae saw oh paw siapharan kalan la ki oh lah, la hopah oh: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Israel ram kya Pachia a um khyh keiccu tou, Ekron khua pachia Baal-zebub kha byakhia khylan nang nynh nae saw hae? Tukeiccuze na kaenaw ikhung kyate na rung vae lan khyh, na chih ccaccing cih,’ a ci cite la hopah oh, oun cipya,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Siapharan nynh minmin kha, “Nanning te tungku khylan yn cceih zah, tuhcite ae hopah oh paw tuh pawcihawpaw ccungccaw mou athua?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “A mingrungpaw ccungccaw, a tae kya saphua taeccia a cciakuhpaw nynh thua,” cite a khung hae. Siapharan nynh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:4">Mat 3.4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:6">Mar 1.6</ref></char></note> “Tishbe khuapaw Elijah latu athua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh ccungccaw sung pangaw uktu rhawbawipaw kha a ccungccaw hae sung pangaw ryte Elijah kalan a saw. Rhawbawipaw tuh mua dung kya a haungpaw Elijah kalan kaethung zah, “Pou Pachia ccungccapaw, siapharan nynh, ‘Yn rungbung sah,’ ae ci,” cite a hopya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Elijah nynh ccungccaw sung pangaw uktu rhawbawipaw kha, “Kae tuh Pachia ccungccapaw ka thua lanze, vaawlang te maee yn ccahbung sah lah, nang te na ccungccaw hae sung pangaw kha ae u oh sah,” a cipya. Te vaawlang te maee yn ccahbung zah, amaw te a ccungccaw hae sung pangaw kha a u hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:54">Luk 9.54</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siapharan nynh ccungccaw sung pangaw uktu ccangpaw rhawbawipaw kha a ccungccaw hae sung pangaw ryte bua a saw. Tuh-e rhawbawipaw nynh kaethung zah Elijah kha, “Pou Pachia ccungccapaw, e hynh siapharan nynh kaw a thopaw nynh thua: Arangte yn rungbung!” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Elijah nynh, “Kae tuh Pachia ccungccapaw ka thua lanze, vaawlang te maee yn ccahbung sah lah, nang te na ccungccaw hae sung pangaw kha ae u oh sah,” a cipya hae. Tetuh Pachia maee tuh vaawlang te yn ccahbung zah amaw te a ccungccaw hae sung pangaw kha a u hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siapharan nynh ccungccaw sung pangaw uktu lu thumnaw rhawbawipaw kha a ccungccaw hae sung pangaw ryte bua a saw. Tukeiccuze ccungccaw sung pangaw uktu lu thumnaw rhawbawipaw tuh cceihthung zah Elijah malang khe a ccukharutung zah, “Pou Pachia ccungccapaw, ka hiinnaw te na ryalahtu hynh-e sung pangaw hae hiinnaw hynh namaw malang aphutepaw beih thua hae sah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Dotua, vaawlang te maee yn ccahbung zah ccungccaw sung pangaw uktu rhawbawi hae lu ning te mih ccungccaw hae sung pangaw cci kha a u hae; thuasalama atu tuh ka hiinnaw hynh na muihnaw kya aphutepaw beih thua sah,” cite a ngiaku. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Elijah kha, “Amaw ryte cceihbung oh; aning kha rih nan,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Elijah tuh thokuh zah amaw ryte siapharan kalan cceihbung hae zah, <verse number="16" style="v" />aning nynh siapharan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nang nynh Ekron khua pachia Baal-zebub kha byakhia khylan locceihtu hae kha na saw hae keiccuze—tuh-e tuh Israel ram kya byakhia lanpaw Pachia a um khyh keiccu tou?—tukeiccuze na kaenaw ikhung kyate na rung vae lan khyh, na chih ccaccing cih, a ci,” cite a hopya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahaziah Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhcite Elijah nynh a hopaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte Ahaziah tuh a chih. Aning tuh ccapaw a hoi khyh keiccuze Judah siapharan Jehoshafat ccapaw Jehoram nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum ningnaw kum khe a neitawpaw Jehoram tuh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Ahaziah nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw kha Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Elijah Vaawlang A Kae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Elijah kha khiccung te vaawlang a hangthung dyn khe Elijah te Elisha tuh Gilgal khua kyate a cceih hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Elijah nynh Elisha kha, “Hein kya la um; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae hynh Bethel kyacia ccia lan yn naw,” a cipya. Elisha nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, nang mah na hiin thyhte, nang kha kae cciataw lan khyh,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Bethel lang a cceihbung hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Bethel khua um hae paw profeh hae phu kheit tuh Elisha kalan oun cceih hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na bawipaw kha atunin na kyate ccaring a lah cih cipaw na nyh tou?” a cipya hae. Te aning nynh, “Ou, ka nyh; daebabi lan um oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elijah nynh, “Elisha, hein kya la um; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae hynh Jeriko lang ccia lan yn naw,” a cipya. Thuasalama Elisha nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, nang mah na hiin thyhte, nang kha kae cciataw lan khyh,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze minmin tuh Jeriko khua lang a cceih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Jeriko khua um hae paw profeh hae phu kheit tuh Elisha kalan oun cceih hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na bawipaw kha atunin na kyate ccaring a lah cih cipaw na nyh tou?” a ci hae. Elisha nynh, “Ou, ka nyh; daebabi lan um oh,” cite a khung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh Elijah nynh Elisha kha, “Hein kya la um; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae hynh Jordan vaw lang ccia lan yn naw,” a cipya. Thuasalama Elisha nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, te nang mah na hiin thyhte, nang kha kae cciataw lan khyh,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze mih lu ning mawte po a cceih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Jordan vaw pe parouhte a thadyn lya hae khe, a cceih buapaw profeh hae sung pangaw tuh minmin te hary asawkunaw khe a thadyn hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Elijah nynh a angkiccua kha lawkuh zah a kue koute tui kha a bua; mih lu ning te laerou kalan a zua kou makhia hae, tui tuh voikheit lang voikheit lang thoh aphiakuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaw he a zua kou hae te, Elijah nynh Elisha kha, “Na kyate law ka thua maw, pawmou kae cyipah cih, yn hopah,” a cipya. Elisha nynh, “Na muisaw kha leit ning beih yn ccousah,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:17">Deu 21.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Elijah nynh, “Nae ngiapaw tuh myarya aru; tuhzemah na kyate law ka thua lyakhe nae muih lan athua ze, tuh-e tuh na mue cih; nae muih khyh zetuh na mue lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccia lalia te bya a hoku cciamang lya hae khe, maee marangle te maee marang nynh minmin lu ning kha thoh phia hae zah, Elijah tuh khiccung te vaawlang a kae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Elisha nynh tuh-e tuh muih zah, “Apang, apang! Israel marangle hae te marang rhawkaw hae!” cite a sia. Tukoute vae tuh Elijah kha muih vae khyh, te a boeining kha kyng zah ccangning lang a seii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:14">2Si 13.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Elijah koute Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Elijah kyate yn ccahpaw angkiccua kha Elisha nynh a khuin, te ki zah Jordan vaw kin khe a thadyn. <verse number="14" style="v" />Elijah kyate yn ccahpaw angkiccua kha lah zah tui kha bua zah, “Elijah Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh teimou a um?” a ci. Tui kha he a bua te, tui tuh voikheit lang voikheit lang thoh phiakuh zah, Elisha tuh khuraw lang po a zua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeriko khua kya um hae paw profeh hae phu kheit nynh asawnaw langte Elisha kha he a muih hae tuh, “Elijah muisaw tuh Elisha tungvaw kya a um,” a ci hae. Te amaw kha tungku khylan cceih hae zah a malang laekhu kya a bakhung hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Dotua, na ryalahtu hae kaening kya athawsaepaw ccungccaw sung pangaw a um hae; minmin nynh cceih hae sah lah, na bawipaw kha a ccung nawlan hae kaw beih pya hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw nynh amaw kha hangthung zah mua ccangkhakheit vawlan tou, tuhkhyhze accya ccangkhakheit kya tou poh a sah kho,” a cipya hae. Elisha nynh, “Thua khyh, minmin kha saw nan oh,” cite a khung hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh a mae phe thah lan cia a soihbia hae tuh, aning nynh, “Saw oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze ccungccaw sung pangaw kha saw hae zah, nin thum lungkhu amaw kha ccung hae zahmah muih khyh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Jeriko khua a um ungpaw Elisha kalan oun ki hae zah, aning nynh minmin kha, “Cceih nan oh cite kae hopah khyh oh tou?” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Elisha nynh Ngaeangnaw A Rae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jeriko khuaccaaw hae nynh Elisha kha, “Dotua, ka bawipaw nynh na muih vae hawte, hynh-e khua a umnaw hmin tuh ahoy; thuasalama tui hoy khyh zah ram kya loohvoi khyh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “Athawpaw pakekhupaw kya loi ruin oh lah, yn pya oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh tuh-e tuh a pya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te tui apounaw tuidy kalan cceih zah loi phing zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, e tui hynh ka thyaasah vae; atu te vae tuh chinaw thuasah, ccaaw ronaw thuasah hynh-e tui kyate pou vae lan khyh, a ci,” cite a ho. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Elisha nynh a ho thyhte, tuh-e tui tuh atunin cia athyaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Elisha tuh tuin kyate Bethel lang a cceihthung; a cciathung cciamang lyakhe khua lungkhu te pise imua hae beihtaraw oun toikuh hae zah, “Lu-opaw, la cceih ccavae! Lu-opaw, la cceih ccavae!” cite a sarya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Aning nynh maeleihkuh zah he a muih hae te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te thya a law hae. Te ramkaw langte vong api sa ning oun pou hae zah pise imua hae sung pali lu ning kha a tei hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin kyate Karmel Mua lang a cceih, tukoute Samaria khua lang a ki.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jehoram nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah siapharan Jehoshafat nynh ram a uknaw kum haw lae taryanaw kum khe, Ahab ccapaw Jehoram tuh Samaria khua kya Israel siapharan lang tang zah, kum haw lae ning a uk. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae, thuasalama a nung te a paaw hawte tuh thua khyh, pawccecize a paaw nynh a la raepaw Baal zohtuh kha a vua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae kha seinaw a raesah hae paw Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam seinaw kha kyngkuh zah cciataw khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Moab te Rhawtukkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab siapharan Mesha tuh tuu a kuatu thua zah, aning nynh Israel siapharan kha tuutaw cciing kheit te tuutepaw cciing kheit kya-e tuuming kha leih a pya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama Ahab he a chih tuh, Moab siapharan nynh Israel siapharan kha a dou. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh ccyh lyakhe Siapharan Jehoram tuh Samaria khua kyate pou zah Israel hae balyn kha a pum hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah siapharan Jehoshafat kalan bya cciasah zah, “Moab siapharan nynh kae hynh yn dou vae; Moab ram kha tuk khylan nae cciakhae cih tou?” a cipya. Aning nynh, “Kae cciakhae cih, kae pankhae cih, ka ccungccaw hae tuh na ccungccaw hae thua hae zah, ka marang hae tuh na marang hae nynh thua hae,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te aning nynh, “Tei laanpi te mou ccia lan?” cite khia zah, Jehoram nynh, “Edom ramkaw laanpi te ccia lan,” cite a khung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel siapharan, Judah siapharan te Edom siapharan tuh a cceih hae; minmin nynh avoikuh lante nin sari a cceih hae tuh, rhawkaw hae elang te mih kya umpaw sahiin hae elang tui um vae khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh Israel siapharan nynh, “Ezou! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening siapharan hae lu thum hynh Moab hae kuih kalan pya khylan hynhsa oun la ko,” a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama Jehoshafat nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan byakhiasah lanpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> profeh tuh hein kya um khyh tou?” a ci. Te Israel siapharan a ryalahtupaw lu kheit nynh, “Elijah kuih tui a bupahtupaw Elisha, Shafat ccapaw tuh hein kya a um,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehoshafat nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh amaw kya a um,” a ci. Tukeiccuze Israel siapharan, Jehoshafat te Edom siapharan tuh Elisha kalan a cceihbung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elisha nynh Israel siapharan kha, “Nang te kae tuh pawmou ah sekuh? Na paaw profeh hae te na nung profeh hae kalan la cceih,” a cipya. Thuasalama Israel siapharan nynh, “Thua khyh; Moab siapharan kuih kalan pya khylan siapharan hae lu thum oun kotupaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “Rya ka lawpyapaw vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, Judah siapharan Jehoshafat hynh pawlang ka la ria khyh zetuh, nanning hynh do mah kae do ry lan khyh oh, muih mah kae ry lan khyh oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama tintang khuathyapaw kha oun kotua oh,” a cipya hae. Te tintang khuathyapaw nynh a khua lyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thungnaw tuh a tungvaw yn thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, ‘E accya hynh tuili hae te phe ka biasah cih,’ a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, ‘Nanning nynh khisan te khuaa kha na muih lan khyh oh, thuasalama naemaw, nae sahiin hae te nae sarangpaw hae nynh na nia lan oh paw tui kha hynh-e accya kyahin phe ka biasah cih,’ a ci. <verse number="18" style="v" />E hynh tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hosyn leipaw rya nynh thua, Moab hae kha mah nae kuih kya ae pya cih oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Khualungrua te koihkuhpaw khua miakaw te ahoypaw khua miakaw kha na tae cih oh; thingku hoypaw miakaw kha na nge cih oh zah tuisung balyn kha laephi na thei cih oh zah laephi hoynaw hmin balyn kha lung te na roh cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Awkhualan, awkhua silawnaw rae ccyh loukaw khe, tui tuh Edom langte vaekheitmawte yn lua zah ram kha pong avu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Siapharan hae nynh tuk lan oun ccianua thung vae hae cipaw kha Moab hae balyn nynh he a nyh hae tuh, rhawtuk-uccaw a lawkuh khopaw balyn, adih huapaw kyate ale huapaw kyacia ko hae zah ramri lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Awkhua takaw he a tho hae tuh, tui vawlan khe khuanin nynh ak zah minmin te arawsekuh lante tui tuh chiise hawte asepaw kha Moab hae nynh a muih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “E hynh chiise nynh thua; siapharan hae tuh lu kheit te lu kheit tukkuh hae zah a theihkuh hae hynhsa. Tukeiccuze Moab hae, luade ccavae oh!” a ci hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae ryahmin kya he a thua hae tuh, Israel hae nynh thonuakuh hae zah Moab hae kha tuk hae zah mih malang khe a ccue hae; Moab ram a tee hae cia Israel hae nynh po a tuk hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Khua hae kha roh hae zah laephi ahoynaw hmin miakaw kha lung vuathin hae zah a bongsah hae. Tuisung miakaw kha laephi thei hae zah, thingku hoypaw miakaw kha a nge hae. Kir-hareseth khua kyalya kha khualungrua um zah, tuh-e khua tuh lung te azaethya hae paw nynh koihlu hae zah a zae hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Moab siapharan nynh ka tukru kho vae lan khyh hae cipaw he a nyh tuh, thaloi kyngpaw ccungccaw za sari kha ko hae zah Edom siapharan kha ro lan a rawse zemah roh kho khyh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tetuh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang cih paw a ccatawccaw kha lah zah, rhawlungrua vawlan khe maee-ute silawnaw kha a raenaw. Tukeiccuze Israel hae tuh myarya mih thinria zah amaw kyate mih ram lang a ki vae hae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Elisha te Nomaenung Chitui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Profeh hae phu kya-e lu kheitpaw zu nynh Elisha kha, “Na ryalahtu ka vawpaw tuh a chih vae; na ryalahtupaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrihpaw nynh thua cipaw kha nang nynh na ny, laebah oun umsahtupaw tuh ka ccaaw hae lu ning kha see lang lawku lan yn thua vae,” cite sia zah a hopya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Elisha nynh amaw kha, “Pawmou kae cyipah cih? Yn hopah, na inn kya pawmou na hoi?” cite khia zah aning nynh, “Na ryalahtunung nynh ka inn kya chitui ang kheit laelan pawpaw mah ka hoi vae khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “Atolang la cceih lah, na innpaw hae balyn kya-e ang hae, accawnghanpaw ang hae patae kha la hoh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te inn lungkhu lang tee lah, namaw te na ccaaw hae nynh thuakaw khawsungkuh oh lah, ang hae lungkhu langkhe chitui ruin oh; chitui he abeihpaw ang miakaw kha akin lang nung oh,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze amaw kyate cceih zah amaw te a ccaaw hae tuh thuakaw a khawsungkuh hae; minmin nynh ang hae kha lawpah hae zah aning nynh chitui a ruin. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ang hae tuh he abeih hae te, a ccapaw kha, “Ccangpaw ang yn lawpah,” cipah zah, aning nynh, “Um vae khyh,” a cipya. Tetuh chitui tuh lua vae khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e nopinung nynh Pachia ccungccapaw kalan cceih zah, tuh-e paw nynh, “La cceih lah, chitui kha la zua lah, na laebah kha la sangkuh, te alaepaw chitui khate nang te na ccaaw hae nynh khua la sah oh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Elisha nynh Imuapaw A Thosah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nin kheit tuh Elisha tuh Shunem khua lang cceih zah, tuin khua kya umpaw mihoinung lu kheit nynh Elisha kha looh-ae a kopya. Tukeiccuze tuh-e laanpi kya a ccia takyh vae ze looh ae khylan tuin kya leih a teepaw. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh a vawpaw kha, “Dotua, aening laanpi tyty a cceih bungthungpaw hynh-e ccungccapaw hynh Pachia ccungccaw mithyaapaw nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Inn tungvaw kya pang thungkuhpaw akhaan taraw rae oh sih lah, amaw elang ikhung, ccaboi, haungnaw te maeekhua ccangkheit kha nungpah oh sih, aening kalan yn thua ze tuin kya a um cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nin kheit tuh Elisha tuh tuin kya yn thua zah, tuh-e akhaan kalan kae zah a ih. <verse number="12" style="v" />A ryalahtupaw Gehazi kyakhe, “Shunam nopinung kha yn kotua,” a cipya. Aning nynh yn ko zah nopinung tuh amaw malang a thadyn. <verse number="13" style="v" />Elisha nynh Gehazi kha, “Nopinung kyakhe, kaening hynh hynhcih ciate nae do-oih zah, pawmou kae cyipah cih? Siapharan kalan thuasah, rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawipaw kalan thuasah hopya na ry hae paw bya a um tou? cite hopya tua,” a cipya. Nopinung nynh, “Kae tuh ka ccungccaw hae laku kya nynh ka um,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “Tuhte athua ze, aning elang pawmou cyipya lanpaw a um?” cite khia zah, Gehazi nynh, “Ahoy, e nopinung hynh ccapaw hoi khyh, a vawpaw tuh ataw vae,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “Nopinung kha yn ko,” a cipya. Aning nynh yn ko zah nopinung tuh thuakaw kya a thadyn. <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “Khuavae atu ccyh kya, khyapaw accyh yn thua te, ccapaw na pom cih,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Gen 18.14</ref></char></note>Nopinung nynh, “Pou Pachia ccungccapaw, ka bawipaw, na ryalahtunung hynh yn ling nan,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nopinung tuh ccaawpoi zah Elisha nynh a hopya thyhte, khyapyapaw accyh he yn thua tuh ccapaw a saah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Imua tuh yn lethung zah nin kheit tuh loohruetu hae kalan a paaw kalan a cceih. <verse number="19" style="v" />A paaw kha, “Ka lu ccih, ka lu ccih!” a cipya. A paaw nynh a ryalahtupaw kha, “A nung kalan cciakhae,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Aning nynh a nung kalan a cciakhae; imua tuh a nung phae vawlan ninthu cia duakuh zah a chih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nopinung nynh cceih zah a rhua kha Pachia ccungccapaw a ikhung vawlan a nung koute thuakaw khawsung zah a cciataw. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te a vawpaw kha ko zah, “Pachia ccungccapaw kalan arangte ka cceih cih zah bua kae ki kho nawlan, ryalahtu lu kheit te lann sa kheit kha yn sawpah hae,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />A vawpaw nynh, “Pawccemou amaw kalan atunin na cceih cih? Sawpaw thawpaw mah thua khyh, sabbath nin mah thua khyh,” a cipya. Aning nynh, “Phe hoy cih,” a cipya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te lann kha khungnin de zah a ryalahtupaw kha, “Lann hynh cciasah, kae hopah leite byabyate yn cciasahpah nan,” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuhcite nopinung tuh cceih zah Karmel Mua kya Pachia ccungccapaw kya a thua.</para>
  <para style="p">Pachia ccungccapaw nynh nopinung yn cciapaw kha he a muih tuh, a ryalahtu Gehazi kha, “Dotua, Shunam nopinung yn cceih; <verse number="26" style="v" />tungku khylan ccuenua lah, Na dan tou? Na vawpaw so a dan tou? Imua so a dan tou? cite la khiatua,” a cipya. Nopinung nynh, “Ka dan,” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Mua vawlan Pachia ccungccapaw kya he a thua te, a ccu kha a pom. Nopinung kha ccaring tuu khylan Gehazi nynh yn naenuaku. Thuasalama Pachia ccungccapaw nynh, “Amaw um lan um sah, pawccecize aning tuh a lungria myarya athae; e kong hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae yn muihsah khyh zah yn hopah khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tetuh nopinung nynh, “Ka bawipaw, ccapaw kae ngiakuh zawtou? Kae hynh yn ling nan, cite kae hopah khyh tou?” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Elisha nynh Gehazi kha, “Taevoiboei voikuh lah, ka hoitang kha ccyngkute cceih. Lukhakheit na tungku oh ze byabeih nan, lukhakheit nynh bya ae beih zemah khungru nan; te ka hoitang kha imua a mae vawlan khe na la khang cih,” a cipya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te imua a nung nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, namaw mah na hiin thyhte, nang kha kae cciataw lan khyh,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Elisha nynh thokuh zah nopinung kha a zui. <verse number="31" style="v" />Gehazi nynh malang cceihlo zah hoitang kha imua mae vawlan a khang zemah pawpaw roi mah ccae khyh, hiinnaw muihsahnawpaw pawpaw mah um khyh. Tukeiccuze Elisha kha tungku khylan yn kinua zah, “Imua tuh tho khyh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Elisha nynh inn lungkhu lang he a tee tuh, achihpaw imua, a ikhung vawlan a ihpaw kha a muih. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tee zah thuakaw khaw zah mih lu ning te a um hae, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan saw a sang. <verse number="34" style="v" />Te ikhung vawlan thokuh zah imua vawlan bakhung zah a mung kha imua mung te, a mit kha imua mit te, a kuih kha imua kuih te a tungsaku; tuhcite imua vawlan a bakhung lyakhe imua ngesaw tuh yn so.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.34-35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:21">1Si 17.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v" />Te Elisha tuh tho zah akhaan lungkhu kya cciabung cciathung a cceih, te imua vawlan bua a bakhung; imua tuh vae sari hachi zah a mit yn dae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Elisha nynh Gehazi kha ko zah, “Shunam nopinung kha yn ko,” cipah zah a ko. Nopinung he yn thua te, Elisha nynh, “Na ccapaw hynh hoei ccavae,” a cipya. <verse number="37" style="v" />Nopinung tuh yn thua zah Elisha a cculeihpaw laekhu kya a bakhung; te a ccapaw kha hoei zah a pou.</para>
  <para style="s1">Elisha nynh Ang A Thyaasah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Elisha nynh Gilgal khua lang a ki lyakhe, tuh-e ram kya ccakan accih. Profeh hae phu kheit tuh amaw malang a haung lya hae khe, aning nynh a ryalahtupaw kha, “Profeh hae phu elang ang pipi khang lah, ehang sahtua,” a cipya. <verse number="39" style="v" />Minmin laku e lukheitpaw tuh enaw-eho lo khylan ramkaw lang a cceih; ram tui-ung ku kha muih zah, athae kha a phu kho zeihte a boei te a poi, te yn thua zah tuh-e tuh aw zah, paw nynh athua cipaw nytaw leite, ehang ang te a thung. <verse number="40" style="v" />A ae ccaw hae cite a suapya hae. Tuh-e tuh a ae lya hae khe, “Pou Pachia ccungccapaw, ang lungkhu kya chinaw a um!” cite sia hae zah, ae kho vae khyh hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “Vaekhui beihtaraw oun cciakhae oh,” cipah hae zah, tuh-e tuh ang lungkhu thung zah, “Ccungccaw hae kha dang oh, ae hae sah,” a ci. Te ang lungkhu kya ri lanpaw pawpaw mah um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Elisha nynh Looh A Dang hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Baal-shalishah khua e ccungccapaw lu kheit nynh yn cceih zah, athae typaw barli te raekuhpaw sanlou phe kuin te a sohrae lungkhu a sangpaw pawhaleihpaw ccathae kha Pachia ccungccapaw kalan a ccyngpya. Elisha nynh, “Ccungccaw hae kha pya hae lah, ae hae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="43" style="v" />Thuasalama a ryalahtupaw nynh, “Hynh-e te ccungccaw za kheit kha pawtemou ka dang kho cih hae?” a ci. Tukeiccuze Elisha nynh, “Ccungccaw hae kha pya hae lah, ae hae sah, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, ‘Minmin nynh a ae cih hae zah, beihtaraw alae ung cih,’ a ci,” cite a hopya. <verse number="44" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha dang hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte, minmin nynh ae hae zah beihtaraw alae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Naaman Dannaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siria siapharan a rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawipaw Naaman tuh a bawipaw malang maehoynaw myarya a ccoupaw te a lesaepaw nynh thua, pawccecize aning liate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Siria ram kha taenaw a pya. Naaman tuh thung zah a rawhoypaw athua zemah vaethya ccinaw a hoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.1-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:27">Luk 4.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Siria hae nynh rhaw thiing hae zah a ccia lya hae khe, vae kheit tuh Israel ram e nopinung taraw lu kheit kha kyng hae zah, aning nynh Naaman zu kha rya a lawpya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e nopinung nynh a bawinung kha, “Ka bawipaw hynh Samaria khua umpaw profeh kalan la cceih sah ci kou ka ry! A vaethya ccinaw hynh a dansah mamin cih,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Naaman nynh a bawipaw kalan cceih zah, Israel ram e nopinung taraw nynh a hopaw bya kha a hopya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Siria siapharan nynh, “La cceih, Israel siapharan kha ccaw ka ky cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">Naaman tuh cceih zah ngunphua talent ccanghaw, sui shekel thong taruh te boeining zung haw kha a phu. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning nynh Israel siapharan kalan ccaw a phupya, tuh-e ccaw kyakhe, “E ccaw hynh na kya he yn thua te, ka ryalahtu Naaman hynh a vaethya ccinaw na dansah nawlan, na kalan kae saw cipaw la nyh,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh tuh-e ccaw he a ria te, a boeining kha seii zah, “Kae tuh chinaw te hiinnaw a pya khopaw Pachia ka thua zah tetou, e ccungccapaw nynh vaethyakaepaw ccungccaw kha dansah khylan ka kalan yn saw? Aning nynh pekunaw yn hyypaw hynh dotua oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh a boeining a seiiku cipaw kha Pachia ccungccapaw Elisha nynh he a thae tuh, siapharan kha byataw zah, “Pawccemou na boeining na seiiku? Tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh kamaw kalan yn cceih sah lah, Israel ram kya profeh a um cipaw a nyh cih,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Naaman tuh a marang hae te a marangle hae ryte yn cceih zah Elisha inn teenaw kya a thadyn. <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisha nynh Namaan kalan locceihtupaw kha saw zah, “La cceih lah, Jordan vaw kya vae sari tui la singkuh, te na ngesaw tuh amaw mamin lang a tang cih zah na thyaa cih,” cite a hosah pya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Namaan tuh thinriate cceih zah, “Profeh tuh ka kalan yn pou cih zah te khaw, a thadyn cih zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia min kha kote ka vaethya ccinaw luki khe a kuih te a zaw cih zah vaethya ccinaw hynh yn dansah cih cite ka tua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Damaskas vaw hae Abana te Pharpar tuh Israel ram e vaw hae balyn laeze hoyhua khyh hae tou? Tuh-e vaw hae kya tui singkute ka thyaa kho lan khyh tou?” a ci. Te maeleihkuh zah thinriate a ki vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />A ryalahtu hae nynh amaw kalan naekuh hae zah, “Apang, profeh nynh ryalaw rupaw law lan kaw ae pya ze, law leite tou na um cih? Aning nynh, ‘Tui la singkuh lah, la thyaa,’ ae cipyapaw hynh hohcihmou cyi lan houh accanhua?” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aning nynh cceihbung zah Pachia ccungccapaw bya thyhte, Jordan vaw kya vae sari a phungku; a ngesaw tuh imua taraw ngesaw hawte thuathui zah, aning tuh athyaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tetuh amaw te a ccungccaw hae balyn tuh Pachia ccungccapaw kalan kite a malang khe thadyn hae zah, “Israel ram kya laelan, laephi pynpi kya Pachia um khyh cipaw ka ny; na ryalahtupaw kya-e lasung hynh beih yn lawpakuh,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama Elisha nynh, “Rya ka lawpyapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, pawpaw mah ka lawkuh lan khyh!” a cipya. Lawku lan a soihbia zemah aning nynh phe a mya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Namaan nynh, “Na mya lan athua ze, na ryalahtupaw hynh lann sa ning phu khinpaw laephi beih yn pya; pawccecize na ryalahtupaw nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan laelan, ccangpaw pawpaw pachia kalan mah maee-ute silawnaw te silawnaw hae kha ka rae vae lan khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na ryalahtupaw hynh ccangkheit tuh beih yn ngaethya sah: ka bawipaw nynh ka kuihbaw kya ngeikute Rimmon inn lungkhu lang tee zah beik khylan a bakhung lyakhe, kae mah Rimmon inn kya ka bakhung bua ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na ryalahtupaw kae hynh yn ngaethya vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Elisha nynh amaw kha, “Ngaengante la cceih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">Thuasalama Naaman tuh syntaraw he a cceih te, <verse number="20" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw Elisha a ryalahtupaw Gehazi nynh, “Siria ccungccaw Naaman nynh a pyapaw lasung kha ka bawipaw nynh lawku leite hung a kisah. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, a nulang te ka deehui cih zah a kya-e hankhakheit kha ka lawkuh cih,” a ci. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Gehazi nynh Naaman kha a deehui. Ka nulang te lukhakheit nynh yn deehui cipaw kha Naaman nynh he a muih tuh, tungku khylan marangle kyate sahkuh zah, “Atyn-are ahoy tou?” cite a khia. <verse number="22" style="v" />Gehazi nynh, “Ahoy, ka bawipaw nynh, ‘Efraim muaram kyate profeh hae phu kya-e lu ning tuh atasy khe ka kalan oun thua hae; ngunphua talent ccangkheit te boeining zung ning kha minmin beih pya hae,’ cite hopya khylan kae hynh yn saw,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Naaman nynh, “Talent ccangning beih lawkuh,” a cipya. Te ngunphua talent ccangning kha boeining zung ning ryte sungkua ccangning khate tungbia hae zah, a ryalahtu hae lu ning kha a pya hae, te minmin nynh Gehazi malang khe phu hae zah a cceih hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Khualungrua kya he a thua hae te, mih tungvaw kya-e sungkua hae kha lah zah inn lungkhu kya a nung; te minmin kha cciasah hae zah a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gehazi tuh tee zah a bawipaw malang a thadyn; te Elisha nynh, “Gehazi, teimou na um?” cite a khia. Aning nynh, “Na ryalahtupaw kae tuh teitei lang mah ka cceih khyh,” cite a khung. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama Elisha nynh, “Nang te tungku khylan ccungccapaw nynh a marangle kyate a sawku lya kha ka muisaw te na kya ka cceihbua khyh tou? Phua te boeining, oliv khokhu hae te misu khokhu hae, tuu hae te tangnuapaw hae, seenung hae te seepaw hae kha lawku ccyh athua zawtou? <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Naaman kya-e vaethya ccinaw tuh nang te na ciihan hae kalan zungzae a kaekuh cih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Gehazi tuh vaethyakae zah vuiraw hawte raw zah, a bawipaw kyate a pou.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hae kha Bua Muenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Profeh hae phu nynh Elisha kha, “Dotua, namaw ryte atu ah umnaw oh hmin tuh myaryasankae aby. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jordan vaw lang cceih oh sih lah, khuing kya thingpyng ccangkheit cci byngte, umnaw hmin sakkuh oh sih,” a cipya hae. Aning nynh, “La cceih oh,” a ci. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin laku e lu kheit nynh, “Na ryalahtu hae kaening kya cceihbua,” cipah zah, Elisha nynh, “Ka cceihbua cih,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin kya a cceihbua. Jordan vaw he a thua hae te, thing hae kha a nge hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Lukheitpaw nynh thing a ryng lyakhe a hae tuh tui lungkhu lang accah; aning nynh sia zah, “Ezou, ka bawipaw! Ka hohpaw hae nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw nynh, “Teikyamou a ccaw?” cite a khia. A ccawnaw hmin kha he a muihsah te, ccungngue kha khya zah tuin kya a saw, te hae tuh yn phaly vae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “Lah ccavae,” cipah zah, tuh-e paw nynh a kuih kha dyng zah a law.</para>
  <para style="s1">Elisha te Siria hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vae kheit tuh Siria siapharan nynh Israel kha a tuk, a kuihkaw e bawi hae ryte khuakhan hae zah, “Tuin hmin, khe hmin kyakhe ka ryahmin tuh tah athua cih,” a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw nynh Israel siapharan kha byataw zah, “E hmin kya na ccia khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh, pawccecize Siria hae tuh tuin hmin kya a cceih cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw nynh a hopaw hmin langkhe Israel siapharan nynh ccungccaw saw zah bya a taw hae. Aning nynh tuh-e hmin tuh a raeringku nawlan hae raeringnaw a pya hae keiccuze vae kheit vae ning lae alung lan a lue hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hynh-e keiccuze Siria siapharan tuh myarya a bungzou; a kuihkaw e bawi hae kha ko hae zah, “Aening laku kya hummou Israel siapharan kalan a pan cipaw nae hopah lan khyh oh tou?” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />A kuihkaw e bawi lu kheit nynh, “Siapharan ka bawipaw, lu kheit san um khyh, na inaw khaan kya na hopaw bya kha Israel ram umpaw profeh Elisha nynh Israel siapharan kha a hopya,” cite a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Siria siapharan nynh, “Cceih oh lah, a umnaw hmin kha la ccung oh; ccungccaw ka saw cih zah ka kyng cih,” a ci. Amaw kha, “Dothan khua kya nynh a um,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e khua langkhe marang hae, marangle hae te rhawkaw patae kha a saw hae; khuazi khe thua hae zah khua kha a koihlu hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw a ryalahtupaw tuh awkhua takaw te tho zah atolang he a pou tuh, rhawkaw hae tuh marang hae te marangle hae ryte khua po voilu lan a um vae hae. A ryalahtupaw nynh, “Ezou, ka bawipaw! Pawtemou ah cyih cih oh?” a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “Rih nan, pawccecize aening kya um hae paw tuh minmin kya um hae paw laeze a lunghua hae,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Elisha nynh sawsang zah, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, a muih kho nawlan a mit beih awsah tua,” a ci. Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuh-e ryalahtupaw tuh a mit awsah zah a muih vae; Elisha a pepan po voilu lan, mua tuh marang hae, maee marangle hae khate phe abeih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Siria hae nynh he a ccianua bung hae tuh, Elisha nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sawsang zah, “E ccungccaw hae hynh mih mit beih mohsah hae,” a ci. Tukeiccuze Elisha nynh saw a sang thyhte, mih mit a mohsah hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Elisha nynh minmin kha, “E laanpi thua khyh, e khua mah thua khyh; yn zui oh lah, na ccung oh paw ccungccapaw kalan kae saw cih oh,” a cipya hae. Te Samaria khua lang a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samaria khua he a tee takaw hae te, Elisha nynh, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, e ccungccaw hae nynh ngaw a muih kho nawlan hae, mih mit beih awsah hae,” a ci. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih mit kha awsah zah, minmin nynh Samaria khua lungkhu a um hae paw kha a nyku hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh minmin kha he a muih hae tuh, Elisha kha, “Apang, minmin hynh ka theih cih hae tou? Ka theih cih hae tou?” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “Na theih lan khyh hae! Na thaloi te na li te na kyng hae paw kha na theih cih hae tou? Minmin nynh ae hae zah a nia ccaw hae, looh te tui kha mih malang khe nungpah hae; te mih bawipaw kalan cceih hae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin elang loohdangnaw poi pi kha a raepya hae; a ae a neih kou hae te cciasah hae zah mih bawipaw kalan a cceih hae. Tuin koute tuh Siria hae nynh thiing khylan Israel ram lungkhu lang tee vae khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Benhadad nynh Samaria A Koihlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccyh syntaraw aro koute, Siria siapharan Benhadad nynh a rhawkaw hae balyn kha pumte Samaria khua kha ccianua zah a koihlu. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ccyh khaw cia a koihlu keiccuze Samaria khua kya ccakan myarya ccih, lann lu ccangkheit kha ngunphua shekel sung tarya lang zua hae zah, vahu ia kab pum pali pum kheit kha shekel ccangpangaw lang a zua hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh khualungrua vawlan a ccia cciamang lyakhe nopinung lu kheit nynh ko zah, “Siapharan ka bawipaw, beih yn bawm!” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae bawm khyh ze, kae nynh pawtemou kae bawm kho cih? Huimin kya-e tou, tuhkhyhze misu mianaw khu kya-e tou kae muepah kho cih?” a cipya. <verse number="28" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Pawmou na vawsaw?” cite khia zah, nopinung nynh, “E nopinung nynh, ‘Na ccapaw kha atunin ae sih lah, awkhualan ka ccapaw kha ae lan,’ yn cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka ccapaw kha kae thungkuh zah kae ae. Awkhualan tuh kae nynh, ‘Na ccapaw kha ae lan vae,’ ka cipya. Thuasalama a ccapaw kha zya a thuruh vae,” cite a hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:57">Deu 28.57</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:10">Raw 4.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Siapharan nynh nopinung bya he a thae tuh, a boeining kha a seii—khualungrua vawlan a ccia lya thua zah, a pyn kya kawdah lang buriboei a lawkupaw kha ccungccaw hae nynh a muih kho hae— <verse number="31" style="v" />te aning nynh, “Shafat ccapaw Elisha a lu tuh a raw vawlan atunin a um zetuh Pachia nynh ka tungvaw kya tuh-e ciate thuasah, tuhlaeze alung lante mah thuasah cyih vae sah,” a ci. <verse number="32" style="v" />Te a umnaw kyate ccungccapaw lu kheit kha a saw.</para>
  <para style="p">Elisha tuh a inn kya haung zah piccan hae tuh amaw kya a haungbua hae. Locceihtupaw yn thua mawkhe, Elisha nynh piccan hae kha, “E ccungccatheihpaw nynh ka lu pae khylan lukhakheit kha yn saw cipaw na nyh oh tou? Locceihtupaw he yn thua te, thuakaw khaw oh lah, thuakaw kin khe phang umkhaw oh. A bawipaw laanccia roi tuh a nulang khe ccae khyh tou?” a ci. <verse number="33" style="v" />Minmin kya bya a ho cciamang lyakhe siapharan tuh amaw kalan yn thua zah, “E vawsawnaw hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate nynh yn thua! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bawmnaw kha pawccemou ka ngaehoi ung cih?” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Elisha nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh ngaetua: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, Awkhualan atu ccyh loukaw kya Samaria khua koikua kyakhe chanvuih khui kha tounawpaw te kaw kheit ze shekel ccangkheit, barli kha tounawpaw te kaw ning ze shekel ccangkheit lang a zua cih hae, a ci,” cite a ho. <verse number="2" style="v" />Siapharan nynh a ngeikunawpaw rhawbawipaw nynh Pachia ccungccapaw kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh vaawlui kya thanlan-aw a la rae ze heize, tuhcihawpaw tuh thua kho vema?” a ci. Elisha nynh, “Na mit ccaccei te tuh-e tuh na muih cih, thuasalama nang tuh na ae lan khyh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siria hae A Ccue hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Koikua atolang khe vaethyakae hae paw lu pali um hae zah minmin nynh, “Ah chi mawlaezung oh hein kyahin pawccemou ah haung cih oh? <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Khua lungkhu lang tee oh sih,’ ci lanze, khua lungkhu ccakanccih zah ah chih cih oh; hein kya ah haung oh zemah chi mamin lan. Tukeiccuze Siria hae ryahmin kalan cceih oh sih; minmin nynh ah hiinnaw oun haang hae ze hiin lan zah, oun chia hae ze chi lan,” cite a hoku hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze zetepakaw khe Siria hae ryahmin lang ccia lan a thokuh hae; thuasalama Siria hae ryahmin kin a thua hae tuh, lu kheit san la um vae khyh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Siria rhawkaw hae kha marangle siho, marang hae siho te rhawkaw patae siho kha a thaesah hae, tukeiccuze minmin nynh, “Israel siapharan nynh aening kha tuk khylan Hit siapharan hae te Izip siapharan hae kha a hohku vae hae,” cite lu kheit te lu kheit a hoku hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin tuh zetepakaw khe ccue hae zah mih bu hae, mih marang hae te mih lann hae kha a vuasya hae, mih ryahmin kha ccuetaw hae zah, mih hiinnaw lue khylan a ccue hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />E vaethyakae hae paw nynh ryahmin kin he a thua hae te, bu lungkhu lang tee hae zah a ae a neih kou hae te, sui, ngun te boeining kha a lawku hae, te cciakhae hae zah a thuruh hae. Tukoute ki hae zah ccangpaw bu lungkhu lang a tee hae, te tuin kya-e uccaw hae kha lawkute cceih hae zah a thuruh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te minmin nynh, “Ah cyisei vae oh. Atunin hynh thongpang hoypaw nin nynh thua; daebabi lan ah um oh zah khua yn dae lanpaw kha ah ngaw oh zetuh, detahnaw nynh oun thuanua cih; tukeiccuze cceih oh sih lah, siapharan innbyn hae kha hopah oh sih,” cite a hoku hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze cceih hae zah khua koikua ngawtu hae kha ko hae zah, “Siria hae ryahmin kalan kae cceih zah, lu kheit sanmah kae muih khyh, roi mah kae thae khyh, a khii hae paw marang hae te lann hae, te bu hae tuh a um mintute a um hae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te koikua ngawtu hae nynh sia hae zah siapharan innbyn hae kha a hopya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Siapharan tuh khuazi khe tho zah a ryalahtu hae kha, “Siria hae nynh aening oun paccynnuaku hae paw hynh kae hopah cih oh. Aening ah ccakan accipaw hynh a ny hae; tukeiccuze ramkaw kya reku khylan mih ryahmin kyate pou hae zah, minmin nynh, ‘Khua kyate he oun pou hae te, mih hiin pite kyng lan hae zah khua lungkhu lang tee lan,’ cite a tuaku hae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />A ryalahtupaw lu kheit nynh, “A laehypaw marang hae sa pangaw hynhte ccungccaw beihtaraw kha saw oh sih lah, dotua oh sih, pawccecize a chih vae hae paw Israel zapi hae balyn hawkhate hein kya a laehy hae paw hynh mah a teing mamin cih hae,” a ci. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze marangle ccikuh hae paw lu ning kha ko hae zah, “La cceih oh lah, la dotua oh,” cite siapharan nynh hopah hae zah, Siria rhawkaw hae nulang deehui khylan a saw hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh Jordan vaw kyacia a deehui hae; Siria hae nynh a rangsakunaw hae ze a vuasya hae paw boeining hae te zunghe hae tuh laanpi kya azung-anaw phe abeih. Locceihtu hae nynh oun ki hae zah siapharan kha a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh khuaccaaw hae nynh pou hae zah Siria hae ryahmin kha a thiing hae. Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte, chanvuih khui kha tounawpaw te kaw kheit ze shekel ccangkheit, barli kha tounawpaw te kaw kheit ze shekel ccangkheit lang a zua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Siapharan nynh a ngeikunawpaw rhawbawipaw kha koikua ngawtu lang a nung; siapharan nynh amaw kalan a ccia lyaze Pachia ccungccapaw nynh a ho hawte, ccungccaw hae nynh tuh-e rhawbawipaw kha koikua kya phe chih lan a syde hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia ccungccapaw nynh siapharan kha, “Awkhualan atu ccyh loukaw kya Samaria koikua kyakhe barli kha tounawpaw te kaw kheit ze shekel ccangkheit, chanvuih khui kha tounawpaw te kaw kheit ze shekel ccangkheit lang a zua cih hae,” cite a hopya lyaze, <verse number="19" style="v" />tuh-e rhawbawipaw nynh Pachia ccungccapaw kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh vaawlui kya thanlan-aw a la rae ze heize, tuhcihawpaw tuh thua kho vema?” cite a khung. Te aning nynh, “Na mit ccaccei te tuh-e tuh na muih cih, thuasalama nang tuh na ae lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />A tungvaw kya tuhcite acyihkuh ccaccing; koikua kyakhe ccungccaw hae nynh amaw kha phe chih lan a syde hae.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Shunam Nopinung nynh Loo A Muethui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Elisha nynh a ccapaw a la hiinsahpyapaw nopinung kha, “Thokuh lah na innbyn hae ryte la cceih oh, khua na sah khonaw hmin miakaw kya la um; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccakannaw kha ko vae zah, ram lungkhu kya kum sari lungkhu ccakanccih cih,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:8-37">2Si 4.8-37</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nopinung nynh thokuh zah Pachia ccungccapaw bya thyhte a cyi; a innbyn hae ryte cceih hae zah Filistin hae ram kya kum sari lungkhu a um hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sari he accing te, nopinung nynh Filistin hae ram kyate ki zah, a inn te a loo bua mue kho nawlan ngiaku khylan siapharan kalan a cceih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Pachia ccungccapaw a ryalahtu Gehazi kha bya hokhae zah, “Elisha nynh alesaepaw rya a lawpaw balyn kha yn hopya tua,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Elisha nynh a chihpaw a hiinsah thuinaw kong kha Gehazi nynh a hopya cciamang lyakhe, a ccapaw a hiinsahpyapaw nopinung nynh a inn te a loo kha bua mue kho nawlan siapharan kha a ngiaku. Gehazi nynh, “Siapharan ka bawipaw, e nopinung hynh kae hopyapaw nopinung thua zah, e ccapaw hynh Elisha nynh a hiinsahpyapaw a ccapaw nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Siapharan nynh nopinung kha he a khia tuh, nopinung nynh a hopya. Tukeiccuze siapharan nynh nopinung elang bawi lu kheit kha naw zah, “A uccaw balyn kha, e ram kyate a pou nin te atu cia a loo kyate a poupaw balyn ryte, amaw kha pyathui oh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Benhadad Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siria siapharan Benhadad acci cciamang lyakhe Elisha tuh Damaskas khua lang a cceih. “Hein kya Pachia ccungccapaw yn thua,” cite he a hopah hae tuh, <verse number="8" style="v" />siapharan nynh Hazael kha, “Lasung ccyngkuh lah, Pachia ccungccapaw kha tungku khylan la cceih. E ccinaw kyate ka dan cih tou cipaw kha aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan yn la khiapya tua sah,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Hazael tuh Damaskas khua e uccaw ahoyhoypaw kha kalauh sung pali te lasung lang phusah zah, amaw kha tungku khylan a cceih. He a thua te, a malang khe thadyn zah, “Na ccapaw Siria siapharan Benhadad nynh kae hynh na kalan yn saw zah, ‘E ccinaw kyate ka dan cih tou?’ a ci,” cite a hopya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisha nynh, “La cceih lah, ‘Solei na dan cih,’ cite la hopah; thuasalama aning tuh solei a chih cih cipaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh phe yn muihsah vae,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Elisha nynh Hazael kha a maesue phe roh lan phang a do. Te Pachia ccungccapaw tuh a rah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Hazael nynh, “Ka bawipaw, pawccemou na raw?” cite khia zah, Elisha nynh, “Israel hae tungvaw na cyi lanpaw hoyleinaw kha ka ny keiccu nynh thua; mih rhawlungrua hae kha maee te na soi cih, mih ccangvae hae kha thaloi te na theih cih hae, mih imua hae kha phe tui lan na noinae cih hae zah ccaawpoipaw mih nopi hae kha mih vue na koi cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Hazael nynh, “Ui sasaw hung ka thuapaw na ryalahtupaw kae nynh pawtemou e ryalaw lepaw hynh ka lah kho cih?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:15">1Si 19.15</ref></char></note>a cipya. Elisha nynh, “Nang nynh Siria siapharan lang na tang lanpaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn muihsah vae,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te aning nynh Elisha kha cciataw zah a bawipaw Benhadad kalan a cceih, te “Elisha nynh paw bya mou ae hopya?” cite a bawipaw nynh khia zah, “Solei a dan cih, yn cipya,” cite a khung. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama awkhualan khe Hazael nynh boei thaawkalaepaw kha lah zah tui kya a dung koute siapharan mae kha bong zah a chih. Te Hazael tuh siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoram nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 21:1-20">2Sh 21.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahab ccapaw Joram nynh Israel siapharan lang a tangnaw kum pangawnaw kum khe, Judah siapharan Jehoshafat ccapaw Jehoram nynh ram kha a uk takaw. <verse number="17" style="v" />Sung thum kum ning he cih te, siapharan lang tang zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum tarya a uk. <verse number="18" style="v" />A zu tuh Ahab ccanung athua keiccuze Ahab ciihan hae nynh a cyi hae hawte, Israel siapharan hae laanpi kha a zui. Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhzemah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu David kyakhe amaw te a ciihan hae kha maeeinn zungzae pya lan bya a la kinpyaku vae keiccuze David liate Judah kha roh khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1Si 11.36</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehoram she lyakhe Edom hae nynh Judah uknaw kha dou hae zah mimaw ccungccaw kha siapharan lang a khangku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:40">Gen 27.40</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Te Joram nynh a marangle hae balyn ryte Zair langkhe a cceih. Khuazi khe pou zah amaw a koihlu hae paw Edom hae te mih marangle uktu bawi hae kha a tuk hae; te a rhawkaw hae tuh inn lang a ccue hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Edom nynh Judah uknaw kha atunin cia a dou. Libnah nynh mah tuh ccyh lyakhe a doubua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Joram nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Joram tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, minmin ryte David khua khe a uukheih hae; a ccapaw Ahaziah tuh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahaziah nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 22:1-6">2Sh 22.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahab ccapaw Joram nynh Israel siapharan lang a tangnaw kum haw lae ningnaw kum khe, Judah siapharan Jehoram ccapaw Ahaziah nynh ram kha a uk takaw. <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahaziah nynh kum kuin lae ning he cih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kya kum kheit a uk. A nung min tuh Athaliah cikuh zah, Israel siapharan Omri a mintanung nynh thua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahaziah tuh Ahab ciihan paeepaw athua keiccuze Ahab ciihan laanpi kha zui zah Ahab ciihan hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahab ccapaw Joram ryte cceih hae zah Siria siapharan Hazael kha Ramoth-gilead kya a tuk hae, tuin kyakhe Siria hae nynh Joram kha maw a muesah hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Siria siapharan Hazael kha tuk zah Siria hae nynh Ramah khua kya a muesah hae paw vaemaw kha dansaku khylan Jezreel khua lang a ki. Judah siapharan Jehoram ccapaw Ahaziah tuh Ahab ccapaw Joram vaemaw a mue keiccuze via khylan Jezreel khua lang a cceih.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jehu kha Chitui Thuhnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tetuh profeh Elisha nynh profeh hae phu kya-e lu kheit kha ko zah, “Na taevoiboei kha voikuh; e chitui bawng hynh lawkuh lah, Ramoth-gilead lang la cceih. <verse number="2" style="v" />He na thua te, Nimshi ccapaw Jehoshafat a ccapaw Jehu kha la ccung; te la tee lah, a ruiban hae kyate na pousah cih zah, alungkhu lang e akhaan lungkhu langkhe na teekhae cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te chitui bawng kha lawte a lu kha na bu cih zah, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nang hynh Israel siapharan lang chitui kae thuh, a ci,’ cite la hopah. Te thuakaw kha na hung cih zah na ccue cih; na thysung nan sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccangvaepaw, profehpaw taraw tuh Ramoth-gilead lang a cceih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawi hae a la pumku lya hae khe aning tuh thua zah, “Pou rhawbawipaw, nang kae hopya lanpaw bya ka hoi,” a cipya. Jehu nynh, “Kaening laku e hummou na hopah cih?” cite khia zah, “Pou rhawbawipaw, namaw kha nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jehu tuh thokuh zah alungkhu lang a tee; ccangvaepaw nynh a lu vawlan chitui bu zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Nang hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae, Israel hae siapharan lang chitui kae thuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:16">1Si 19.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu profeh hae chiise te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu hae balyn chiise kha a luasah keiccuze Jezebel tungvaw phu ka law nawlan, na bawipaw Ahab ciihan hae kha na theih cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahab ciihan balyn tuh a roh cih hae; Israel ram kya umpaw a luepaw thuasah, a lue leipaw thuasah Ahab ciihan pise miakaw kha ka vua cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahab ciihan kha Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam ciihan hawte thuasah, Ahijah ccapaw Baasha ciihan hawte thuasah ka cyih cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ui nynh Jezebel kha Jezreel ram kya a ae cih, humhung nynh mah amaw kha uh lan khyh,” a cipya. Tukoute thuakaw kha hungkuh zah a ccue.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:23">1Si 21.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jehu tuh a bawipaw ryalahtu hae kalan he yn thua te, minmin nynh, “Atyn-are ahoy tou? Mingaeepaw kha pawccemou na kalan yn ccia?” cite a khia hae. Aning nynh, “Khah-e paw te a bya kha phe na ny oh,” cite a khung hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Thua khyh! Oun hopya tua!” a ci hae. Tukeiccuze Jehu nynh, “Aning nynh kae yn hopyapaw bya tuh: ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, nang hynh Israel siapharan lang chitui kae thuh,’ a ci,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh mih balynte mih angkiccua kha palou lah hae zah ccu synaw kyakhe Jehu kha a phaepya hae; te mungkae tu hae zah, “Jehu tuh siapharan nynh thua,” cite a sia hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Siapharan Joram Chianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhcite Nimshi ccapaw Jehoshafat a ccapaw Jehu nynh Joram kha rawse zah a phee. Joram tuh Israel hae balyn ryte Siria siapharan Hazael kha dou khylan Ramoth-gilead kya a um hae; <verse number="15" style="v" />thuasalama Siapharan Joram tuh Siria siapharan Hazael a tuk lyaze Siria hae nynh a muesah hae paw maw kha dansaku khylan Jezreel lang a ki vae. Te Jehu nynh, “E hynh na ry oh zetuh, e thongpang hynh Jezreel khua kya ho khylan, e khua kyate humhung mah ccia sah nan oh,” a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehu tuh a marangle kha ccikuh zah, a dan leipaw Joram a umnaw Jezreel khua lang a cceih. Judah siapharan Ahaziah tuh Joram via khylan a cceih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jezreel khua rhawviainn kya a thadynpaw rhawviatu nynh Jehu te a ccungccaw hae oun ccia hae paw kha he a muih tuh, “Ccungccaw phu kheit ka muih,” a ci. Joram nynh, “Marang rhawkaw lu kheit ko lah, minmin te tungku khylan la sawtua, te aning nynh, ‘Daenaw te athua tou?’ cite khia hae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze marang rhawkawpaw nynh Jehu kha tungku khylan ccianua zah, “Siapharan nynh, ‘Daenaw te athua tou?’ a ci,” cite a hopya. Jehu nynh, “Nang nynh daenaw tuh pawmou na se? Maeleihkuh lah, ka nulang te yn zui,” a cipya. Rhawviatu nynh, “Locceihtupaw tuh minmin kya a thua vae, thuasalama yn ki vae khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te lu ningnaw marang rhawkawpaw kha a saw, tuh-e paw tuh minmin kya thua zah, “Siapharan nynh, ‘Daenaw te athua tou?’ a ci,” cite a hopya hae. Jehu nynh, “Nang nynh daenaw tuh pawmou na se? Maeleihkuh lah, ka nulang te yn zui,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Rhawviatu nynh, “Locceihtupaw tuh minmin kya a thua vae, thuasalama yn ki vae khyh. Marangle kha mingaeepaw hawte a mawng keiccuze Nimshi ccapaw Jehu nynh a mawngpaw te nynh aloku,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joram nynh, “Paccyn oh,” a ci keiccuze a marangle kha a paccyn hae. Israel siapharan Joram te Judah siapharan Ahaziah tuh mih marangle raveih kha ccikute Jehu te tungku lan cceih hae zah, Jezreel khuapaw Naboth khokhu khe a tungkuh hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Joram nynh Jehu kha he a muih te, “Jehu, daenaw te athua tou?” a cipya. Jehu nynh, “Na nung Jezebel nynh a raepaw ohhuakunaw te naawthyanaw patae a um lungkhu balyn tuh daenaw a um kho cih zawtou?” cite a khung. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Joram nynh maeleihkute ccue zah Ahaziah kha, “Pheekunaw nynh thua, Ahaziah!” a cipya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Jehu nynh a thawzung balynte a li kha suete Joram kha a raw te a raw laku kya a kaw; the nynh a bung kha tung zah Joram tuh a marangle kyate a khuliakuh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehu nynh amaw a bawmtu Bidkar kha, “Hang lah, Jezreel khuapaw Naboth laephi kyakhe vua; nang te kae nynh a paaw Ahab nulang marang ah cciku lyaze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha rawsete hynh-e bya a hopaw kha na syntaw ung cih: <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Naboth chiise te a ccapaw hae chiise kha inkhawnin ka muih, e laephi kyahin nang kha liaru lan bya ka kinku,’ cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Tukeiccuze a rhua kha hang lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte laephi kyakhe vua,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:19">1Si 21.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Judah Siapharan Ahaziah A Chia hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah siapharan Ahaziah nynh tuh-e tuh he a muih tuh, Beth-haggan langkhe a ccue. Jehu nynh deehui zah, “Amaw kha mah kaw oh!” cipah hae zah, Ibleam pe Gur khua lang kaenaw laanpi kya marangle kyakhe a kaw hae. Te Megiddo khua lang ccue zah, tuin kya a chih. <verse number="28" style="v" />A kuihkaw e bawi hae nynh a rhua kha marangle te Jerusalem lang phu hae zah, David khua kya amaw shawku kyakhe a minpaaw hae ryte a uukheih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahab ccapaw Joram nynh Israel siapharan lang a tangnaw kum haw lae kheitnaw kum khe Ahaziah nynh Judah ram kha a uk takaw.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jezebel Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jehu tuh Jezreel khua a thua cipaw kha Jezebel nynh a thae; a mit kha asi thuhkute a lu kha ccaankuh zah thanlan-aw kyate ngaw a do. <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehu nynh sakoih kya a tee lyakhe, Jezebel nynh, “A bawipaw a theihtupaw Zimri, daenaw te athua tou?” a cipya. <verse number="32" style="v" />Jehu nynh thanlan-aw kalan khe do zah, “Hummou ka kalan a pan? Hummou?” a ci. Tinriapaw ccungccaw hae lu ning lu thum nynh amaw kha thanlan-aw kyate a do hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Jehu nynh, “Khah-e nung kha yn vua oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze vua hae zah a chii nynh pang te marang hae kha pia hae zah tuh-e hae nynh a syde hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Te aning nynh tee zah a ae a neih koute, “Thyalawnaw a muepaw nopinung hynh do oh lah, uh oh, pawccecize aning tuh siapharan ccanung nynh thua,” a ci. <verse number="35" style="v" />Thuasalama uu lan cite he a cceih hae tuh, a luru, a ccu te a kuihphe laelan pawpaw mah muih vae khyh hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Oun ki hae zah Jehu kha he a hopah hae tuh, aning nynh, “E hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu Tishbe khuapaw Elijah kyate ho zah, ‘Ui hae nynh Jezebel saw kha Jezreel ram kya a ae cih hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:23">1Si 21.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v" />e hynh Jezebel shawku nynh thua, cite humhung nynh mah a ho khyh nawlan hae, Jezebel rhua tuh ia hawte Jezreel ram loo kya a um cih,’ a ci,” cite a ho.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahab Ciihan hae Chianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahab nynh Samaria khua kya ccapaw hae sung sari a hoi. Tukeiccuze Jehu nynh ccaw zei zah Jezreel khua uktu hae, piccan hae te Ahab ccapaw hae a do-oihtu hae a umnaw hae Samaria khua langkhe ccaw ky hae zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nae bawipaw ccapaw hae tuh nae kya um hae zah, marangle hae, marang hae, koihpaw khua hae te zunghe hae mah nae kya a um hae keiccuze, <verse number="3" style="v" />nae bawipaw ccapaw hae kyaze asung-e huaccepaw kha po oh lah, a paaw bawitungkhung kya haungsah oh lah, nae bawipaw ciihan elang rhawtukpah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh myarya rih hae zah, “Dotua oh, siapharan hae lu ning tuh amaw malang thadyn kho khyh hae, pawtemou aening nynh ah thadyn kho cih oh?” a ci hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan inn do-oihtu, khua a uktu, piccan hae te imua do-oihtu hae nynh Jehu kha byataw hae zah: “Kaening tuh na ryalahtu hae nynh kae thua; na hopaw miakaw kae cyih cih. Humhung mah siapharan lang kae khangkuh lan khyh; ahoy na ci hawte cyih ccaleih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Jehu nynh minmin kalan vae ningnaw ccaw zei zah, “Kamaw kalan na pan oh zah, ka bya na ngae oh zetuh, nae bawipaw a ccapaw hae lu kha pae oh lah, awkhualan atu ccyh kya ka kalan Jezreel khua lang oun cceih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e ccaw tuh minmin kya he a thua te, siapharan ccapaw hae kha ko hae zah milu sung sari a chia hae; mih lu hae kha shua kya sang hae zah, Jezreel khua lang Jehu kalan a ky hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Locceihtu hae tuh oun thua hae zah, “Siapharan ccapaw hae lu kha oun thuakhae vae hae,” cite hopah hae zah, Jehu nynh, “Koikua teenaw kyakhe awkhualan awkhua cia san ning lang pum oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Awkhualan awkhua khe Jehu tuh he a pou te, thadyn zah ccungccaw hae balyn kha, “Nanning tuh seinaw na hoi khyh oh. Ka bawipaw a pheetu te a theihtu tuh kamaw nynh ka thua; thuasalama hynh-e hae balyn hynh hum nynh mou a theih hae? <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Ahab ciihan te asekuh lante a hopaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ccangkheit sanmah laephi kalan ccah lan khyh cipaw nyh oh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu Elisha kyate a hopaw kha a cyi vae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jezreel khua kya a laehypaw Ahab ciihan hae balyn, a kuihkaw e bawi hae, a ruiban hoypaw hae te ranpibawi hae kha lu kheit san hiin leite a chia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:4">Hos 1.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te thokuh zah Samaria lang a cceih. Laanpi kya Tuurin hae hmin Beth-eked kya he a thua tuh, <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah siapharan Ahaziah puizia hae ryte tungkuh hae zah, Jehu nynh, “Hum hae mou na thua oh?” cite khia hae zah, minmin nynh, “Ahaziah puizia hae nynh kae thua; siapharan ccapaw hae te siapharannung a ccapaw hae kha tungku khylan nynh kae ccia,” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Jehu nynh, “Minmin hynh ahiinte kyng oh,” a cipya hae. Minmin kha ahiinte kyng hae zah Beth-eked hunghua kyakhe mih balynte sung pali lu ning a chia hae; aning nynh lu kheit sanmah hiin khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin kyate he a cceih te, Rekhab ccapaw Jehonadab tuh amaw te tungku khylan yn cceih; Jehu nynh byabeih zah, “Ka thinlung tuh na tungvaw ading hawte, nang na thinlung so ka tungvaw ading tou?” cite khia zah, Jehonadab nynh, “Ou, ading,” a cipya. Jehu nynh, “Athua lanze, na kuih kha yn pya,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze a kuih kha pya zah, Jehu nynh amaw kalan marangle lungkhu lang a suebua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehu nynh, “Ka kya cceihbua lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang ka lungthawsaenaw hynh dobua tua,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze a marangle kya a ccisaku bua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Samaria khua he a thua te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Elijah kya a hopaw a bya thyhte, Samaria khua kya Ahab ccungccaw a hiinhy hae paw miakaw kha mih cii phe mih lan a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Baal Beik hae paw Chianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Jehu nynh ccungccaw balyn kha pum hae zah, “Ahab nynh Baal kha beihtaraw kyalya rya a lawpya; thuasalama kae, Jehu nynh rya patae ka lawpah cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Baal profeh hae balyn, a beiktu hae balyn te a ranpibawi hae balyn kha ka kalan oun ko oh; lu kheit sanmah mesei nan oh, pawccecize Baal elang myarya lepaw silawnaw kha ka raepah cih; mesei athuapaw miakaw tuh hiin lan khyh,” a ci. Thuasalama Jehu nynh Baal a beik hae paw kha chiathya nawlan a phee hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehu nynh, “Baal elang athyaapaw pumkunaw kha rae oh,” cite kaw a tho. Tukeiccuze tuh-e tuh a thaesah hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Jehu nynh Israel ram pynpi kya byataw hae zah, Baal a beikpaw miakaw tuh khaleih a thua hae, a thua leipaw lu kheit san um khyh. Baal beikinn lungkhu lang tee hae zah, Baal beikinn tuh voikheit lang te voikheit lang cia phe abeih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehu nynh boeining nungnaw a do-oihtu kha, “Baal a beik hae paw balyn elang boeining hae kha yn thuaa hae,” cipah zah, aning nynh a thuaapya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Jehu tuh Rekhad ccapaw Jehonadab ryte Baal beikinn lungkhu lang tee hae zah, “Nanning laku kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a beikpaw lu kheit san a um khyh nawlan ccungtua oh, Baal a beikpaw kyalya um hae sah,” a ci. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te silawnaw hae te maee-ute silawnaw hae kha rae khylan a tee hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Jehu nynh ccungccaw sung tarya kha atolang khe nung hae zah, “Nae kuih kya kae pya oh paw hynh-e hae lukhakheit a luesahpaw ccungccaw tuh a hiinnaw a shung cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Maee-ute silawnaw kha he a thangsah takaw te, Jehu nynh rhawviatu hae te bawi hae kha, “Tee oh lah, theih oh; lu kheit sanmah luesah nan oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh thaloi te a bae hae. Rhawviatu hae te bawi hae nynh minmin kha atolang vua hae zah, Baal beikinn alungkhu lang e akhaan kalan a tee hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Baal beikinn lungkhu umpaw zohtuh hae kha lah hae zah maee te a soi hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Baal zohtuh te Baal beikinn kha roh hae zah, ia-inn lang atunin cia a mang hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhcite Jehu nynh Baal kha Israel ram kyate a maemih. <verse number="29" style="v" />Thuasalama Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh Israel hae kha seinaw a raesahnaw hae paw sui vaetuataw hae, Bethel khua te Dan khua a um hae paw kha Jehu nynh vua khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-30">1Si 12.28-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jehu kha, “Ka muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha hoyte na cyih zah, ka thinlung kya a umpaw balyn thyhte Ahab ciihan hae kya na cyi keiccuze na ccapaw hae tuh she pali cia Israel bawitungkhung kya a haung cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="31" style="v" />Thuasalama Jehu nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Israel Pachia kawbya kha a thinlung balyn te zui lan raeringkuh khyh; Jeroboam nynh Israel hae a raesah hae paw seinaw kha vua khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehu Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuin ccyh lyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel ram abang kha a aw bang. Hazael nynh Israel ram kha: <verse number="33" style="v" />Jordan vaw nithua lang, Gilead ram abalyn, Gad phin hae, Reuben phin hae te Manasseh phin hae ram, Arnon Vaw pe umpaw Aroer khua kyate Gilead ram te Bashan ram kyacia a tae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jehu nynh rya a lawpaw, a cyipaw balyn te a huhan balyn tuh Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Jehu tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah Samaria kya a uu hae. A ccapaw Jehoahaz nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehu nynh Samaria khua kyate Israel ram kha kum kuin lae tarya a uk.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Athaliah nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 22:10-23:15">2Sh 22.10—23.15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaziah a nung Athaliah nynh a ccapaw a chipaw kha he a nyh tuh, thokuh zah siapharan innbyn hae balyn kha a chia hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan Joram ccanung, Ahaziah ccianung nynh Ahaziah ccapaw Joash kha chia athua vae cih hae paw siapharan ccaaw hae kyate zya ruh zah amaw te a do-oihtu kha inaw khaan kya a thuruh hae. Tuhcite amaw kha chia athua khyh nawlan, Athaliah kyate zya a thuruh; <verse number="3" style="v" />Athaliah nynh ram a uk lungkhu balyn, Joash tuh Jehosheba ryte kum taruh lungkhu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya a rekuh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoiada nynh Imua Joash Chitui A Thuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kum sarinaw kum khe ranpibawi Jehoiada nynh Karet ccungccaw hae kya-e rhawbawi hae, rhawviatu hae kya-e rhawbawi hae kha amaw kalan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang a kosah hae. Minmin ryte byakinnaw rae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyakhe bya a kinsaku hae; te siapharan ccapaw kha a muihsah hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiada nynh, “Hynhte na cyih cih oh: sabbath nin kya rya na hoi oh paw nanning laku e pum thum pum kheit nynh siapharan inn kha na ngaw cih oh, <verse number="6" style="v" />(ccangpaw pum kheit nynh Sur sakoih kya na ngaw cih oh zah ccangpaw pum thum pum kheit nynh rhawviatu hae nulang umpaw sakoih kyakhe na ngaw cih oh); tuhcite siapharan inn kha na ngaw cih oh; <verse number="7" style="v" />sabbath nin kya rya na hoi lei oh paw phu ning nynh siapharan kha thungkhaw khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kha na ngaw cih oh, <verse number="8" style="v" />zunghe ccarou ccyngkute siapharan kha na koihlu cih oh; te a koihlutu rhawkaw hae kalan yn naekuhpaw miakaw tuh chia athua cih. Siapharan nynh a pou a tee vae ze, tyty na zui cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ranpibawi Jehoiada nynh kaw a pya hae thyhte rhawbawi hae nynh marya a cyi hae; minmin lu kheit cci nynh sabbath nin kya rya a hoi cih lei hae paw mih ccungccaw hae te sabbath nin kya rya a hoi cih hae paw mih ccungccaw hae kha cciakhae hae zah ranpibawi Jehoiada kalan ccarou a thuakhae hae. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya umpaw ccoi hae te khawriaphua hae kha ranpibawi nynh rhawbawi hae kalan a pya hae; <verse number="11" style="v" />rhawviatu hae tuh zunghe ccarou ccyngkute siapharan kha voikheit voikheit langte thungkhaw khylan, silawhang te beikinn kha po voilu lan alia te palung cia a thadyn hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te ranpibawi nynh siapharan ccapaw kha yn poukhae zah bawilukhung khungsah zah byakinnaw ccauh kha a pya; siapharan lang khang hae zah chitui a thuh hae; mih kuihbia hae zah, “Siapharan tuh a hiinshe sae vae sah!” cite a sia hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Athaliah Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rhawviatu hae roi te ccungccaw hae roi kha Athaliah nynh he a thae tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang ccungccaw hae kalan a tee; <verse number="14" style="v" />he a do tuh, aphung thyhte siapharan tuh tungpi pe thadyn zah, rhawbawi hae te mungkae tu hae paw tuh siapharan pe um hae zah, ram lungkhu e ccungccaw balyn tuh mih lungpaw zah mungkae a tu hae paw kha a muih. Athaliah nynh a boeining kha seii zah, “Pheekunaw nynh thua! Pheekunaw nynh thua!” cite a sia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:3">2Si 23.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Rhawkaw hae uktu lang khang athua hae paw rhawbawi hae kha Jehoiada nynh, “Aning hynh rhawkaw hae laku kyate poukhae oh, amaw a zuipaw miakaw kha thaloi te theih oh,” a cipya hae. Pawccecize ranpibawi nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu kya amaw kha chia thua nan sah,” a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh a kyng hae; te siapharan inn lang teenaw marang sakoih kyate poukhae hae zah tuin kya a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada nynh minmin tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw athua nawlan hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> te siapharan te ccungccaw zapi hae laku kya byakinnaw kha a rae; siapharan te zapi hae laku kya mah a rae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te ramccungccaw hae balyn nynh Baal beikinn kha ccianua hae zah a ro hae; a silawhang hae, a zohtuh hae kha palae tui lan koi hae zah Baal ranpibawi Mattan kha silawhang hae malang khe a chia hae. Ranpibawi nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya rhawviatu hae kha a nung hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aning nynh rhawbawi hae, Karet ccungccaw hae, rhawviatu hae te ramccungccaw hae balyn kha a cciakhae hae; te minmin nynh siapharan kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyate siapharan inn langkhe rhawviatu hae sakoih kyate a cciakhae hae. Te siapharan hae kya-e bawitungkhung kyakhe Joash kha a haungsah. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ramccungccaw hae balyn tuh mih lungpaw; Athaliah kha thaloi te siapharan inn kya a theih kou hae te tuh, khuapi kya daenaw a um vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joash tuh kum sari acih te, ram kha a uk takaw.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Sakthuinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 24:1-16">2Sh 24.1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehu nynh Israel siapharan lang a tangnaw kum sarinaw kum khe, Joash nynh ram kha a uk takaw; Jerusalem khua kya kum sung pali a uk. A nung min tuh Zibiah cikuh zah Beersheba khuanung nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ranpibawi Jehoiada nynh a ccangpya keiccuze Joash nynh a she lungkhu balyn <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama ahangpaw hmin hae kha tuh roh khyh hae; ccungccaw hae nynh ahangpaw hmin hae vawlan khe silawnaw po rae hae zah mynkhuhpaw kha a u mamin hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joash nynh ranpibawi hae kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang athyaapaw ahlu lante thuakhaepaw phua, khyapya thyhte milu raveih nynh a pya hae paw phua—khyapya thyhte ccungccaw hae kyate muepaw phua te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang lungthote a thuakhae hae paw phua hae balyn kha<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Exo 30.11-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />ranpibawi hae nynh a hlutu hae raveih kya-e kha lah hae sah; te beikinn kha cyithui ahonaw miakaw cyihthui hae sah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Siapharan Joash nynh ram a uknaw kum kuin lae thum accing cia ranpibawi hae nynh beikinn kha cyihthui loh khyh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Siapharan Joash nynh ranpibawi Jehoiada te ccangpaw ranpibawi hae kha ko hae zah, “Pawccemou beikinn kha na cyithui khyh oh? Tukeiccuze atu tuh a hlutu hae kya-e phua kha lah nan vae oh, beikinn cyithuinaw hanlan pya ccavae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ranpibawi hae nynh ccungccaw hae kya-e phua kha law leite, inn kha mah cyithui lei lante mih nawccah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te ranpibawi Jehoiada nynh thingkua kha lah zah ahu kyakhe akhu vih zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang teenaw ranglang sang, silawhang pe khe a nung; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang oun thuakhae hae paw phua miakaw kha thuakaw ngaw hae paw ranpibawi hae nynh tuh-e thingkua lungkhu lang a sang hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thingkua lungkhu kya phua patae a um cipaw he a nyh hae te, siapharan a ryaccinkhanpaw te ranpibawi lupi nynh oun cceih hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya a muih hae paw phua kha ria hae zah sungkua lungkhu a sang hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />A ria vae hae paw phua kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn a do-oihpaw ryalahtu hae kuih kya a pya hae; te minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya ryalah hae paw lehccama hae, inn sak hae paw, <verse number="12" style="v" />pazan thya hae paw, lung-awthya hae paw kha pya hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn cyithuinaw lanpaw thing a-awkuh vae paw te lung adeihkuh vae paw re nawlan te inn cyithuinaw elang ahoboupaw miakaw kya a mang hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn elang ngun banangpi, tetakia hae, pakekhupaw hae, mungkae hae, sui angphe hae te ngun angphe hae kha tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang a thuakhae hae paw phua hae te rae khyh hae, <verse number="14" style="v" />pawccecize tuh-e phua tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn cyithuinaw kya ryalah hae paw kha pya athua hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ryalahtu hae pya lan cite mih kuih kya phua pya athua hae paw ccungccaw hae nynh hmerarih lan rya a law hae keiccuze minmin kha phua ccazing khia vae khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:7">2Si 22.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Cyiseinaw silawnaw phua te seithyaanaw silawnaw phua kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang teekhae khyh hae; tuh-e phua tuh ranpibawi hae nynh a lawku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:7">Lev 7.7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Hazael nynh Jerusalem A Huraw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Siria siapharan Hazael nynh Gath khua kha ccianuate tuk zah a law. Hazael nynh Jerusalem kha ccianua lan he a nounuakuh tuh, <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah siapharan Joash nynh a minpaaw hae, Judah siapharan hae Jehoshafat, Jehoram te Ahaziah nynh byakinkute a hlu hae paw uccaw hae te amaw nynh byakinkute a hlupaw uccaw hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn te siapharan inn kya-e sisuakhaan kya muih athuapaw sui balyn kha lah zah Siria siapharan Hazael kalan a ky. Tetuh Hazael nynh Jerusalem kha a kitaw.</para>
  <para style="s1">Joash Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Joash nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />A kuihkaw e ryalahtu hae nynh aruh lante phee hae zah, Silla khua lang ccianaw laanpi kya umpaw Millo inn kyakhe Joash kha a chia hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaw a theihtu hae tuh a ryalahtu hae, Shimeath ccapaw Jozakar te Shomer ccapaw Jehozabad nynh thua hae. David khua khe a minpaaw hae ryte a uukheih hae; te a ccapaw Amaziah nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jehoahaz nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaziah ccapaw Joash nynh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kum kuin lae thumnaw kum khe, Jehu ccapaw Jehoahaz nynh Israel ram kha Samaria khua kyate a uk takaw; aning nynh kum haw lae sari a uk. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae, Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh Israel hae a raesah hae paw seinaw hae kha cciataw leite a zui. <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh Israel tungvaw maee lang rua zah, Siria siapharan Hazael te Hazael ccapaw Benhadad kuih kalan Israel hae kha atu te atu a pya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te Jehoahaz nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ngia zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a thaepya; pawccecize Siria siapharan nynh Israel hae kha tuaasah hae zah, tuaasahkunaw a teingnaw hae kha aning nynh a muih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Siria hae kuih kyate a lue nawlan hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel kha khumtu a pya; Israel ccungccaw hae tuh langmawlya hawte mimaw inn kya khua a sah hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Jeroboam nynh Israel a raesahpaw Jeroboam ciihan seinaw kha cciataw leite a zui hae; Asherah zohtuh kha mah Samaria khua kya a um ung. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jehoahaz a rhawkaw hae tuh marang rhawkaw sung pangaw, marangle ccanghaw te ccu rhawkaw thong haw laeze alung lan um vae khyh hae; pawccecize Siria siapharan nynh minmin kha roh hae zah huimin kya-e vuiping hawte a syde hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jehoahaz nynh rya a lawpaw, a cyipaw balyn te a thungnaw tuh Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoahaz tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, Samaria khua kya a uu hae; a ccapaw Joash nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoash nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah siapharan Joash nynh Judah ram a uknaw sung thum kum sarinaw kum khe, Jehoahaz nynh Israel ram kha Samaria khua kyate a uk takaw; aning nynh kum haw lae taruh a uk. <verse number="11" style="v" />Aning nynh zemah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae; Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh Israel hae a raesah hae paw seinaw balyn kha cciataw leite a zui hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Joash nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn, Judah siapharan Amaziah a dou lya-e a thungnaw tuh Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Joash tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, a bawitungkhung kya Jeroboam nynh a haung; Joash tuh Israel siapharan hae ryte Samaria khua kya a uu hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Elisha Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisha tuh a chisah cih paw ccinaw te he a ccih tuh, Israel siapharan Joash nynh ccianua zah a malang khe rah zah, “Apang, apang! Israel marangle hae te a marang rhawkaw hae!” cite a sia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:12">2Si 2.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Elisha nynh amaw kha, “The te li yn lah,” cipah zah, aning nynh the te li kha a law. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Elisha nynh Israel siapharan kha, “Li kha sue,” cipah zah, aning nynh li kha a sue. Elisha nynh a kuih kha siapharan kuih vawlan a khang. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Elisha nynh, “Nithua lang e thanlan-aw kha hung,” cipah zah, aning nynh a hung. Elisha nynh, “Kaw” cipah zah a kaw. Te aning nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e taenaw the, Siria taenawpaw the! Pawccecize Afek khua e Siria hae kha phe thang lan na tuk cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Elisha nynh po ho zah, “The hae kha lah hae,” cipah zah aning nynh a law. Israel siapharan kha, “Khah-e hae khate laephi kha bua,” cipah zah, aning nynh vae thum a bua koute a umtaw. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh Pachia ccungccapaw tuh aning tungvaw a thinria zah, “Vae pangaw, vae taruh cia na bua lanpaw khaw athua; tuhcite na bua zetuh Siria hae kha phe thang lan na tae cih hae, thuasalama atu tuh Siria hae kha vae thum cia kyalya na tae cih hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elisha tuh chih zah a uu hae. Moab ccungccaw aphu hae nynh Israel ram kha hawnin ccyh lyakhe leih a thiing hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccapaw lu kheit a uu lya hae khe, ccungccaw hoylei hae paw phu kheit kha muih hae zah, tuh-e michi rhua tuh Elisha shaw lungkhu lang a vua hae; tuh-e paw nynh Elisha ru kha he a ty miakaw te, hiinthui zah a thadyn.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel nynh Khua hae A Lawthui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Siria siapharan Hazael nynh Jehoahaz she lungkhu balyn tuh Israel kha a tuaa a sah. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha thawccih hae zah ngaethya a umsah hae; Abraham, Isak te Jakob kya a la raepaw a byakinnaw keiccuze minmin kalan khe maekuh zah minmin kha roh khyh hae, amaw malang te atu cia dee khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Siria siapharan Hazael he a chih te, a ccapaw Benhadad nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="25" style="v" />Hazael nynh tuk zah Jehoash a paaw Jehoahaz kuih kyate a la lawpaw khua hae kha Jehoahaz ccapaw Jehoash nynh Hazael ccapaw Henhadad kuih kyate bua a law. Joash nynh Benhadad kha vae thum cia tae zah Israel khua hae kha bua a law.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Amaziah nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 25:1-24">2Sh 25.1-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joahaz ccapaw Joash nynh Israel siapharan lang a tangnaw kum ningnaw kum khe, Joash ccapaw Amaziah tuh Judah siapharan lang a tang takaw. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ram a uk takaw lya tuh kum kuin lae pangaw acih vae, Jerusalem khua kya kum kuin lae takua a uk. A nung min tuh Jehoaddin cikuh zah Jerusalem khuanung nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi, tuhzemah a minpaaw David hawte tuh thua khyh; atyn-are kya a paaw Joash nynh a cyi hawte a cyi. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama ahangpaw hmin hae kha tuh roh khyh; ccungccaw hae nynh ahangpaw hmin hae vawlan khe silawnaw po rae hae zah mynkhuhpaw kha a u mamin hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Siapharan kawhoinaw kha a kuih kya tynkaring lan he a um takaw te, a paaw, siapharan a la theihtu hae a ryalahtu hae kha a chia hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Moses phungbya ccauh kyaze, “Ccaaw hae hanlan nungpaaw hae kha chia thua lan khyh hae, nungpaaw hae hanlan ccaaw hae kha chia thua lan khyh hae; mimaw seinaw hanlan rou nynh chia athua cih hae,” cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw a pya thyhte, a theihtu hae paw mih ccaaw hae kha tuh theih khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Deu 24.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaziah nynh Loi Accya kyakhe Edom hae kha thong haw a chia hae, Sela khua kha lah zah Jokthe-el cite minphu zah atunin cia a min lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaziah nynh Israel siapharan, Jehu ccapaw Jehoahaz a ccapaw Jehoash kalan khe locceihtu hae saw hae zah, “Yn cceih lah, lu kheit te lu kheit hawiliakute doku tua sih,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel siapharan Jehoash nynh Judah siapharan Amaziah kalan byataw zah, “Lebanon mua e hinpawbu nynh Lebanon mua e sidar thingku kalan byataw zah, ‘Na ccanung kha ka ccapaw zu lang yn pya,’ a cipya; te Lebanon e loramsaw sa kheit nynh po a ccia lyakhe hinpawbu kha a syde. <verse number="10" style="v" />Edom ram kha na tae ccaccing zah, na thinlung na hangsakuh vae. Na phu-enaw khate na lungryachikhaekuh sah lah, innvaw khe zya um; pawccecize namaw te Judah ram tuh khuliaku khylan pawccemou vawsawnaw kha na ccungku?” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama Amaziah nynh ngae ry khyh. Tukeiccuze Israel siapharan Jehoash tuh cceih zah, Judah ram Beth-shemesh kyakhe Judah siapharan Amaziah te hawiliakute rhaw a tukkuh hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel nynh Judah kha tae zah, mih inn raveih lang pong a ccue hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel siapharan Jehoash nynh Judah siapharan Amaziah kha Beth-shemesh kyakhe a kyng; Amaziah tuh Jehoash ccapaw, Jehoash tuh Ahaziah ccapaw nynh thua; te Jerusalem lang cceih zah Jerusalem khualungrua kha Efraim Koikua kyate Apaki Koikua kyacia dong za pali a ro. <verse number="14" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya a umpaw te siapharan inn e sisuainn kya a umpaw miakaw sui, ngun te angphe balyn kha lah zah, rhaw hae nynh a la kyng hae paw ccungccaw hae ryte Samaria khua lang a ki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jehoash nynh a cyipaw, a thungnaw te Judah siapharan Amaziah a tuknaw kong kha Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehoash tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, Israel siapharan hae ryte Samaria khua kya a uu hae; te a ccapaw Jeroboam nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah siapharan Joash ccapaw Amaziah tuh Israel siapharan Jehoahaz ccapaw Jehoash a chih koute kum haw lae pangaw a hiin ung. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Amaziah nynh a cyi hae paw kha Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem khua kya Amaziah kha phee hae zah Lakhish khua lang a ccue. Lakhish khua lang ccungccaw deehuisah hae zah, tuin kya a chia hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />A rhua kha marang te Jerusalem lang phusah hae zah, a minpaaw hae ryte David khua khe a uukheih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah ccungccaw hae balyn nynh kum haw lae taruh acih vae paw Amariah kha ko hae zah, a paaw Amaziah ccelang siapharan lang a khang hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Siapharan Amaziah tuh a minpaaw hae ryte a ih kou hae te, Amariah nynh Elath khua kha raethui zah Judah ram lungkhu lang bua a nung.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jeroboam II nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joash ccapaw Amaziah tuh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kum haw lae pangawnaw kum khe, Joash ccapaw Jeroboam tuh Israel siapharan lang tang zah Samaria khua kyate ram kha a uk takaw; aning nynh sung pali kum kheit a uk. <verse number="24" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha rae zah, Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh Israel hae a raesah hae paw seinaw balyn kha cciataw khyh. <verse number="25" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh a ryalahtu Gath-hefer khuapaw Amattai ccapaw, profeh Jonah kyate a la hopaw bya thyhte, aning nynh Israel ram kha Hamath khua teenaw kyate Arabah Rili kyacia bua a law.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:1">Jon 1.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawccecize Israel hae nynh a teing hae paw riathaenaw tuh myarya accih cipaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a muih; kyngpaw ccungccaw thuasah, a luepaw thuasah Israel a bawm lanpaw lu kheit san um vae khyh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel min kha vaawlui zakaw te ka thee cih cite ho khyh, tukeiccuze Joash ccapaw Jeroboam kuih khate a khum hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jeroboam nynh rya a lawpaw, a cyipaw balyn te a thungnaw, rhaw a tuknaw, Judah kya-e a la thuapaw Damaskas te Hamath khua hae kha Israel elang pawtemou bua a law cipaw kha Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Jeroboam tuh Israel siapharan hae, a minpaaw hae ryte a ih hae; te a ccapaw Zekhariah tuh a paaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Azariah nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 26:1-23">2Sh 26.1-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeroboam nynh Israel siapharan lang a tangnaw kum kuin lae sarinaw kum khe, Amaziah ccapaw Azariah tuh Judah siapharan lang a tang takaw. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh kum haw lae taruh a ci lyate ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kyate sung pangaw kum ning a uk. A nung min tuh Jekoliah cikuh zah Jerusalem khuanung nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />A paaw Amaziah nynh a cyi hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama ahangpaw hmin hae kha roh khyh hae; ccungccaw hae nynh ahangpaw hmin hae vawlan khe silawnaw po rae hae zah mynkhuhpaw kha a u mamin hae. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh siapharan kha de a tah keiccuze a chih cia vaethya ccinaw kae zah taekhiate inn ccangpaw kya a um. Siapharan ccapaw Jotham nynh siapharan inn kha do-oih zah ram kya-e ccungccaw hae kha a uk hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Azariah nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn kha Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Azariah tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, a minpaaw hae ryte David khua kya a uu hae; a ccapaw Jotham nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:1">Isa 6.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Zekhariah nynh Israel kha A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siapharan Azariah nynh Judah ram a uknaw sung thum kum taryanaw kum khe, Jeroboam ccapaw Zekhariah nynh Israel ram kha Samaria khua kyate sawpaw sah taruh a uk. <verse number="9" style="v" />A minpaaw hae nynh a cyi hae hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae. Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh Israel hae a raesah hae paw seinaw hae kha cciataw khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jabesh ccapaw Shallum nynh phee zah ccungccaw zapi hae malang khe phe chih lan bua zah, tuh-e paw ccelang ram kha a uk. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Zekhariah nynh a cyipaw kha Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />E hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jehu kya, “Na ccapaw hae nynh Israel bawitungkhung vawlan she pali cia a haung cih hae,” cite bya a kinpyaku thyhte acyihkuhpaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:30">2Si 10.30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Shallum nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah siapharan Uzziah nynh ram a uknaw sung thum kum takuanaw kum khe, Jabesh ccapaw Shallum nynh Israel ram kha a uk takaw; aning nynh Samaria khua kyate sawpaw sah kheit a uk. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Gadi ccapaw Menahem tuh Tirzah khua kyate cceihthung zah Samaria khua a thua; aning nynh Jabesh ccapaw Shallum kha Samaria khua kya bua zah a theih koute tuh-e paw ccelang ram kha a uk. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Shallum nynh a cyipaw te ccungccaw a pheenaw kha Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Menahem nynh Tappuah khua te a lungkhu um hae paw balyn, Tirzah khua kyate tho zah Tappuah khua pepan um hae paw kha a ro hae; koikua a hungpya khyh hae keiccuze khua kha a ro. Ccaawpoipaw nopi hae balyn kha mih vue a pawsah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Menahem nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah siapharan Azariah nynh ram a uknaw sung thum kum takuanaw kum khe, Gadi ccapaw Menahem nynh Israel ram kha a uk takaw; aning nynh Samaria khua kya kum haw a uk. <verse number="18" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae; Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh Israel hae a raesah hae paw seinaw miakaw kha a she lungkhu balyn cciataw khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Assiria siapharan Pul nynh Israel ram kha a dou; Menahem nynh a siapharan thungnaw a kyngpaw kha atyn kho nawlan, Pul kha ngun talent thong kheit a pya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Assiria siapharan pya lanpaw phua tuh Menahem nynh Israel hae, mihoi hae balyn kha lu kheit ze ngun shekel sung pangaw ccite nangsete a ngia hae. Tukeiccuze Assiria siapharan tuh ki zah, tuin ram kya um khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Menahem nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Menahem tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, a ccapaw Pekahiah nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pekahiah nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah siapharan Azariah nynh ram a uknaw kum sung pangawnaw kum khe Menahem ccapaw Pekahiah nynh Israel ram kha Samaria khua kyate uk takaw zah kum ning lungkhu a uk. <verse number="24" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae; Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh Israel hae a raesah hae paw seinaw hae kha cciataw khyh. <verse number="25" style="v" />A rhawbawipaw Pekah, Remaliah ccapaw nynh Argob te Arieh ryte Gilead ccungccaw hae sung pangaw ryte Pekahiah kha phee hae zah, Samaria khua kya siapharan inn rhawlungrua koihkuhpaw lungkhu khe theih hae zah, Pekah nynh tuh-e paw ccelang ram kha a uk. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Pekahiah nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pekah nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah siapharan Azariah nynh ram a uknaw sung pangaw kum ningnaw kum khe, Remaliah ccapaw Pekah nynh Israel ram kha Samaria khua kyate uk takaw zah, kum kuin lungkhu a uk. <verse number="28" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae; Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh Israel hae a raesah hae paw seinaw hae kha cciataw khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel siapharan Pekah ccyh lyakhe Assiria siapharan Tiglath-pileser tuh yn thua zah Ijon, Abel-besh maakah, Janoah, Kedesh, Hazor, Gilead te Galilee, Naftali ram balyn kha a law; ccungccaw hae kha kyngte Assiria ram lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Uzziah ccapaw Jotham nynh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kum kuinnaw kum khe, Elah ccapaw Hoshea nynh Pekah kha phee zah a theih koute ram kha amaw nynh a uk. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Pekah nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Israel Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jotham nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 27:1-9">2Sh 27.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Remaliah ccapaw Pekah nynh Israel siapharan lang a tangnaw kum ningnaw kum khe, Judah siapharan Uzziah ccapaw Jotham nynh ram kha a uk takaw. <verse number="33" style="v" />Aning tuh kum kuin lae pangaw acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah Jerusalem khua kya kum haw lae taruh a uk. A nung min tuh Jerusha cikuh zah Zadok ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="34" style="v" />A paaw Uzziah nynh a cyi hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuhzemah ahangpaw hmin hae kha roh khyh hae; ccungccaw hae nynh ahangpaw hmin hae vawlan khe silawnaw po rae hae zah mynkhuhpaw kha a u mamin hae. Aning nynh Bawipaw inn thahlang sakoih kha a rae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jotham nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Siria siapharan Rezin te Remaliah ccapaw Pekah kha Judah ram dou khylan a saw takaw hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Jotham tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, a minpaaw David khua kyakhe a minpaaw hae ryte a uukheih hae; a ccapaw Ahaz nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahaz nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 28:1-27">2Sh 28.1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Remaliah ccapaw Pekah nynh Israel ram a uknaw kum haw lae sarinaw kum khe, Jotham ccapaw Ahaz tuh Judah siapharan lang a tang takaw. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh kum kuin acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah Jerusalem khua kya kum haw lae taruh a uk. A minpaaw David hawte thua leite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia muihnaw kya hoynaw kha rae khyh zah, <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel siapharan hae laanpi kha a zui. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae malang te a dee hae paw minphuin hae kya-e anungsikuhpaw cyisahnaw thyhte, a ccapaw khate heize maee-ute silawnaw a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:31">Deu 12.31</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahangpaw hmin hae vawlan, mua hae vawlan te hinlalyhpaw thingku kaw miakaw khe silawnaw rae zah mynkhuhpaw kha a u.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Siria siapharan Rezin te Israel siapharan Remaliah ccapaw Pekah nynh Jerusalem kha tuk khylan a ccianua hae; Ahaz kha a koihlu hae zemah tae kho khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:1">Isa 7.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Edom siapharan nynh Edom elang Elath khua kha bua lah zah, Judah hae kha a dee hae; te Edom hae tuh Elath khua lang oun thua hae zah tuin kya atunin cia a um hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahaz nynh Assiria siapharan Tiglath-pileser kalan locceihtu hae saw hae zah, “Kae tuh na ryalahtu te na ccapaw nynh ka thua. Yn cceihthung lah, kae yn tuk hae paw Siria siapharan te Israel siapharan kuih kyate beih yn luesah tua,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu te siapharan inn sisuakhaan hae lungkhu umpaw sui te ngun kha mah lah zah Assiria siapharan kha lasung lang a ky. <verse number="9" style="v" />Assiria siapharan nynh a bya ngaepyate Damaskas kha ccianua zah a law; a ccungccaw hae kha kyngte Kir khua lang a cciakhae hae, te Siapharan Rezin kha a chia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahaz Siapharan tuh Assiria siapharan Tiglath-pileser kha tungku khylan he a cceih tuh, Damaskas khua umpaw silawhang kha a muih. Ahaz Siapharan nynh ranpibawi Uriah kalan silawhang pungsan, adi-ale te raezia balyn kha akaw-aleih asasite a ky. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ranpibawi Uriah nynh silawhang kha a rae; Siapharan Ahaz nynh Damaskas khua kyate a ky thyhte, Damaskas khua kyate Ahaz Siapharan yn thua mawkhe Uriah nynh a rae vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Siapharan tuh Damaskas khua kyate he yn thua te, siapharan nynh silawhang kha a do. Te siapharan nynh silawhang tuh naenuakuh zah a vawlan kae zah, <verse number="13" style="v" />maee-ute silawnaw te ccathae silawnaw kha rae zah niapaw silawnaw kha a bu; ccawkunaw silawnawpaw achii khate silawhang kha a thei. <verse number="14" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang umpaw sohin silawhang kha beikinn malang te, amaw silawhang te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn laku kyate nue zah a silawhang thahlang sang khe a nung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1-2">Exo 27.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:1">2Sh 4.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahaz Siapharan ranpibawi Uriah kha kawpya zah, “Silawhang lepaw vawlan khe awkhua maee-ute silawnaw te zete ccathae silawnaw, siapharan kya-e maee-ute silawnaw te a ccathae silawnaw, ramccungccaw balyn kya-e maee-ute silawnaw, mih ccathae silawnaw te mih niapaw silawnaw kha na rae cih; te maee-ute silawnawpaw achii miakaw te silawnawpaw achii miakaw khate silawhang kha na thei cih; thuasalama sohin silawhang tuh kae nynh Pachia bya ka khianawpaw lang a um cih,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahaz Siapharan nynh kaw a pyapaw miakaw atyn-are kha ranpibawi Uriah nynh a cyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahaz Siapharan nynh beikinn lungkhu umpaw a thadynnawpaw tung hae kha moi hae zah, tuh-e hae vawlan umpaw pakekhupaw hae kha mah a nue hae; tui tungnawpaw kua kha sohin tangnuapaw hae vawlan khate nue zah, aphaekuhpaw lung vawlan khe a nung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:23-39">1Si 7.23-39</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:2-6">2Sh 4.2-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Sabbath nin looh-aesung nawlan siapharan inn kya a sak hae paw avawlan adawkuhpaw kha thuasah, siapharan nynh atolang te a teenaw kha thuasah Siria siapharan keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyate a nue. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Ahaz nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahaz tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, a minpaaw hae ryte David khua khe a uukheih hae; a ccapaw Hezekiah nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:28">Isa 14.28</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hoshea nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah siapharan Ahaz nynh ram a uknaw kum haw lae ningnaw kum khe, Elah ccapaw Hoshea nynh Samaria khua kyate Israel ram kha uk takaw zah, kum takua a uk. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae, thuasalama aning maw e Israel siapharan hae zeih tuh hoyleinaw rae khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Assiria siapharan Shalmaneser nynh amaw kha a tuk; Hoshea tuh a kuihkaw umpaw lang tang zah, ngunto kha a pya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama Assiria siapharan nynh Hoshea tungvaw kya hynhunaw a muih; pawccecize Izip siapharan So kalan khe locceihtu hae kha saw zah, Assiria siapharan kalan kum takyh a la pyapaw ngunto thyhte pya vae khyh; tukeiccuze Assiria siapharan nynh Hoshea kha kyng zah thong a saw.</para>
  <para style="s1">Assiria lang Israel Cciakhaenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Assiria siapharan nynh Israel ram balyn kha tuk zah Samaria khua kya thua zah kum thum lungkhu a koihlu. <verse number="6" style="v" />Hoshea nynh ram a uknaw kum takuanaw kum khe, Assiria siapharan nynh Samaria khua kha lah zah, Israel hae kha kyngte Assiria lang a cciakhae hae. Minmin kha Halah ram, Gozan vaw pe, Habor ram kya te Media ccungccaw hae kya-e khua hae kyakhe a nung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Izip ram te Izip siapharan Faro kuih kyate a poukhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia tungvaw kya Israel ccungccaw hae nynh a sei hae. Ccangpaw pachia hae kha beik hae zah, <verse number="8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae malang te a dee hae paw minphuin hae phung te Israel siapharan hae nynh a raepya hae paw phung hae kha a zui hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kha rawsete ahme leipaw kha aruh lante a rae hae. Mih khua takyh kyakhe rhawviainn kyate khualungrua kyacia ahangpaw hmin hae kha a raeku hae; <verse number="10" style="v" />ahangpaw mua miakaw vawlan te hinlalyhpaw thingku miakaw kaw khe zohtuh hae te Asherah kha a bingku hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:23">1Si 14.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />mih malang te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a deepya hae paw minphuin hae nynh a cyi hae hawte, ahangpaw hmin hae balyn vawlan khe silawnaw a rae hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thinriasahte hoyleinaw kha a rae hae; <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “E hynh na cyih lan khyh oh,” cite a hopya hae paw zohtuh hae kha minmin nynh a beik hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel te Judah kha profeh miakaw te muihdaetu miakaw kyate raeringnaw pya hae zah, “Ahoy leipaw nae laanpi kyate maekuh oh lah, nae minpaaw hae kya kaw ka pya hae paw te ka ryalahtu profeh hae kyate kae pya oh paw ka phunglang hae balyn thyhte, ka kawbya hae te ka phungbya hae kha zui oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh ngae ry khyh hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia a zyn lei hae paw mih minpaaw hae nynh mih lungkhung hawte mih lungkhungbua. <verse number="15" style="v" />A phungbya hae, mih minpaaw hae ryte a la raepaw a byakinnaw te raeringnaw a pya hae paw kha pawlangria khyh hae. Ahme leipaw zohtuh hae kha zui hae zah mimaw mah ahme leipaw lang a tang hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin a cyi hae hawte na cyihbua lan khyh oh, cite kaw a pya hae paw mih pepan e minphuin hae kha a zui hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kawbya kha vua hae zah alaeekuhpaw vaetuataw zohtuh hae ccangning te Asherah kha a raeku hae; vaawlang umpaw aphuinphuin kha beik hae zah Baal kha rya a lawpya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">1Si 12.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Mih ccapaw hae te mih ccanung hae khate silawnaw a rae hae; apawepaw te kuihdothyanaw kha a mang hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha rae khylan mimaw toulou kha zuakuh hae zah a thin a riasah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:10">Deu 18.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Israel tungvaw myarya a thinria zah a muihnaw kyate a dee hae; Judah phin laelan phin kheit san um vae khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah phin hae mah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kawbya hae kha zui khyh hae, Israel hae nynh a raeku hae paw phung hae kha a zui hae. <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel ciihan balyn kha a vua hae; minmin kha a muihnaw kyate a zosah makhia hae, detah hae zah luadetu hae kuih kalan a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel kha David ciihan kyate he a seii te, minmin nynh Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam kha siapharan lang a khang hae. Jeroboam nynh Israel kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> zuinaw kyate cciakhaesei zah, seinaw lepaw kha a raesah. <verse number="22" style="v" />Jeroboam nynh a seipaw seinaw balyn kha Israel ccungccaw hae nynh seibua hae zah, cciataw khyh hae; <verse number="23" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu profeh hae balyn kyate a la hoty vae hawte, Israel kha a muihnaw kyate a dee mawlaezung, minmin nynh tuh-e seinaw kha cciataw khyh hae. Tukeiccuze Israel hae tuh mih ram kyate Assiria ram lang atunin cia see lang a kyng hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Samaria kya Umsathuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Assiria siapharan nynh Babilon, Kuth, Avva, Hamath te Sefarvaim khua kyate ccungccaw hae kha cciakhae hae zah Samaria ram e khua hae kyakhe Israel ccungccaw hae ccelang a nung hae; minmin nynh Samaria ram kha lawkuh hae zah a khua hae kyakhe a um hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin kya he a um takaw hae te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha beik khyh hae; tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh chindeih hae kha sawnua hae zah minmin abang kha a tei hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Assiria siapharan kyakhe, “Nang nynh na cciakhae hae zah Samaria ram e khua hae kya na nung hae paw minphuin hae nynh tuin ram e pachia phunglang kha nyh khyh hae; tukeiccuze aning nynh chindeih hae kha sawnua hae zah minmin kha a chia hae; pawccecize tuin ram e pachia phunglang kha nyh khyh hae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tetuh Assiria siapharan nynh, “Tuin ram kyate na cciakhae oh paw ranpibawi hae laku e lu kheit kha tuin ram lang bua saw oh; la cceih sah lah, tuin kya la um sah, tuin ram e pachia phunglang kha la ccangpah hae sah,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Samaria khua kyate a cciakhae hae paw ranpibawi hae laku e lu kheit tuh ki zah Bethel khua kya a um; aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha pawtemou beik lan cipaw a ccangpya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thuasalama minphuin miakaw nynh mimaw pachia raveih kha raekuh hae zah, Samaria hae nynh a la rae hae paw ahangpaw hmin hae kya umpaw hminthyaa hae kyakhe a nung hae, minphuin miakaw nynh mih umnaw khua raveih kyakhe a nung hae; <verse number="30" style="v" />Babilon ccungccaw hae nynh Sukkoth-benoth pachia, Kuth ccungccaw hae nynh Nergal pachia, Hamath ccungccaw hae nynh Ashima pachia kha a raeku hae; <verse number="31" style="v" />Avva ccungccaw hae nynh Nibhaz pachia te Tartak pachia kha a raeku hae; Sefarvaim ccungccaw hae nynh Sefarvaim pachia hae Adrammelek te Anammelek pachia hae kalan khe mih ccaaw hae kha maee-ute si a lawnaw hae. <verse number="32" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha mah beik hae zah, mimaw laku e ccungccaw huataw hae kha hmin hangpaw hae kya-e ranpibawi hae lang a khangku hae, tuh-e hae nynh minmin elang hmin hangpaw hae kya umpaw hminthyaa hae kyakhe silawnaw a raepya hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik hae zemah oun ccianaw hae minphuin hae nynh a la cyi hae hawte, mih pachia hae kha mah rya a lawpya hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Langmawlya e mih cyisahnaw phung kha atunin cia a zui hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha beik khyh hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel cite min a phupaw Jakob a ccaaw hae kya kaw a pya hae paw kawbya, phunglang, phungzae hae te phungbya hae kha zui khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Gen 32.28</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 35:10">35.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin ryte byakinnaw raete kawpya hae zah, “Nanning nynh ccangpaw pachia hae kha na beik lan khyh oh, mih malang na bakhung lan khyh oh, rya na lawpah lan khyh oh zah si na law lan khyh oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Exo 20.5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:9">Deu 5.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v" />Izip ram kyate myarya lepaw a thungnaw te a dyngpaw a kuih te ae poukhae oh paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na beik cih oh; amaw malang na bakhung cih oh zah, amaw kalan si na law cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Deu 6.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v" />Nae hanlan a zeipaw kawbya, phunglang, phungzae hae te phungbya hae kha zui lan tyty na raeringkuh cih oh. Ccangpaw pachia hae kha na beik lan khyh oh; <verse number="38" style="v" />nanning ryte ka raepaw byakinnaw kha na ning lan khyh oh. Ccangpaw pachia hae kha na beik lan khyh oh, <verse number="39" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha na beik cih oh; aning nynh nae rhaw hae balyn kuih kyate ae luesah cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh ngae khyh hae, langmawlya e mih cyisahnaw phung kha a zui mamin hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuhcite hynh-e minphuin hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik hae zemah a laeeku hae paw mih zohtuh hae kha mah a beik mamin hae; mih ccaaw hae te mih ccaaw hae ccaaw hae nynh atunin cia mih minpaaw hae nynh a la cyi hae hawte a cyi hae.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekiah nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 29:1-2">2Sh 29.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 31:1">31.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elah ccapaw Hoshea nynh Israel siapharan lang a tangnaw kum thumnaw kum khe, Ahaz ccapaw Hezekiah tuh Judah siapharan lang a tang takaw. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning tuh kum kuin lae pangaw he acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum kuin lae takua a uk. A nung min tuh Abi cikuh zah Zekhariah ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Aning nynh a minpaaw David nynh a cyi hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahangpaw hmin hae kha a ro hae, zohtuh hae kha tingsah hae zah Asherah kha a nge hae. Moses nynh a la raepaw daw hupaw kha palae tui lan a koi, pawccecize Israel hae nynh tuin ccyh kyacia tuh-e hupaw kalan silawnaw a rae hae; tuh-e hupaw tuh Nehushtan a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Nam 21.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kha a doliaku; tukeiccuze Judah siapharan hae balyn laku kya amaw tahawpaw lu kheit san um khyh, aning maw e siapharan hae laku kya mah la um khyh. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha tynkaring lan a kyngku; amaw nulang tyty zuikuh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kaw a la pyapaw kawbya hae kha a zui hae. <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh amaw kya um zah a ccianaw takyh kya a laan a sui a ua. Assiria siapharan kha dou zah ryalawpah khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Filistin hae kha tuk hae zah Gaza khua te a ukpaw ram kyacia, rhawviainn kyate akoihkuhpaw khua kyacia a tae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezekiah Siapharan nynh ram a uknaw kum palinaw kum, Israel siapharan Elah ccapaw Hoshea nynh ram a uknaw kum sarinaw kum khe, Assiria siapharan Shalmaneser nynh Samaria khua kha ccianuate koihlu zah, <verse number="10" style="v" />kum thum athangnaw khe a law. Hezekiah siapharan nynh ram a uknaw kum taruhnaw kum, Israel siapharan Hoshea nynh ram a uknaw kum takuanaw kum khe Samaria kha a law. <verse number="11" style="v" />Assiria siapharan nynh Israel hae kha kyngte Assiria ram lang cciakhae hae zah, Gozan vaw pe, Halah ram, Habor ram kya te Media ccungccaw hae kya-e khua hae kyakhe khua a sahsah hae, <verse number="12" style="v" />pawccecize minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia bya kha ngae leite a byakinnaw kha a ei hae—<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu Moses kya kaw a pyapaw balyn kha a ei hae; minmin nynh ngae khyh hae zah zui mah zui khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Sennakherib nynh Judah A Thiing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 32:1-19">2Sh 32.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-22">Isa 36.1-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hezekiah Siapharan nynh Judah ram a uknaw kum haw lae palinaw kum khe, Assiria siapharan Sennakherib nynh Judah ram e rhawlungrua te akoihlukuhpaw khuapi hae balyn kha ccianua thung hae zah a law hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah siapharan Hezekiah nynh Lakhish khua umpaw Assiria siapharan kalan ccungccaw saw hae zah, “Ka cyisei vae; kae hynh yn kitaw; ka tungvaw nae khangpaw miakaw ka phu cih,” cite bya a taw. Assiria siapharan nynh Judah siapharan Hezekiah kha ngunphua talent za thum te sui talent sung thum kha a ngia. <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu te siapharan e sisuakhaan lungkhu umpaw ngunphua balyn kha a pya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Hezekiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn thuakaw kya-e sui te Judah siapharan Hezekiah nynh thuakawtung hae kya a theinawpaw sui kha amaw nynh lah zah Assiria siapharan kha a pya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Assiria siapharan nynh Tartan, Rabsaris te Rabshakeh kha rhawkaw patae ryte Lakhish khua kyate Jerusalem umpaw Hezekiah Siapharan kalan a saw hae. Minmin nynh cceih hae zah Jerusalem a thua hae. He a thua hae te, Boeikuatu hae Loo lang cceihpaw laanluepi pe umpaw, palung tuili kya-e tuizypi pe khe a thadyn hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Siapharan kha he a ko hae tuh, Hilkiah ccapaw, siapharan inn a do-oihtu Eliakim, ryaccinkhan Shebnah te Asaf ccapaw ccawzeitu Joah tuh minmin kalan oun cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rabshakeh nynh minmin kyakhe, “Hezekiah kha hynhte la hopah oh: Alesaepaw siapharan, Assiria siapharan nynh hynhte a ho: E na zynkunaw hynh paw tungvaw kya mou na tynsah? <verse number="20" style="v" />Bya maesae hynh rhawtuknaw elang hawnaw te thungnaw nynh thua cite tou na tua? Nang nynh kae hynh dou lan ciate hummou na doliaku? <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaw kya a ngeikuhpaw ccungccaw miakaw kuih a thuingtupaw, akhyapaw phaeku hoitang athuapaw Izip ram kha na doliaku. Tuhcite Izip siapharan Faro nynh amaw a doliakuh hae paw balyn kha a cyi hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning nynh, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia kha kae doliaku,’ na ci oh ze, aning tuh Hezekiah nynh Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kha, ‘Jerusalem umpaw hynh-e silawhang malang hin na beik cih oh,’ cite hopah hae zah, a hmin hangpaw hae te a silawhang hae a ropyapaw pachia kha thua khyh tou? <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu ka bawipaw Assiria siapharan kyakhe byakinkuh oh: Nanning nynh marang a ccikuh khopaw na mue oh ze, marang thong ning kae pya cih oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nanning nynh marangle te marang rhawkaw hae kha mue khylan Izip ram kha doliakute, ka bawipaw kya-e ryalahtu adihhua hae paw laku e rhawbawi lu kheit sankaw kha pawtemou na dou kho cih oh? <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, e ram ro khylan kae ccianua thungpaw hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bawmnaw leite athua zawtou? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, E ram hynh ccianua thung lah, rotua, yn cipya,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tetuh Hilkiah ccapaw Eliakim, Shebnah te Joah nynh Rabshakeh kyakhe, “Thawccinawte na ryalahtu hae hynh Aramaik bya te beih oun hopah, pawccecize mang kae thae; khualungrua vawlan a um hae paw nynh a thae lan hae te, Judah bya te oun hopah nan,” a cipya hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Rabshakeh nynh, “Ka bawipaw nynh e bya hynh nae bawipaw te nanning kalan ho lan yn saw zawtou? Khualungrua vawlan haung hae zah, nanning ryte mih ia kha aete mih zuin a neih cih hae paw kalan yn saw khyh tou?” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Te Rabshakeh nynh thadyn zah Judah bya te thawte sia zah, “A lesaepaw siapharan, Assiria siapharan bya hynh ngaetua oh! <verse number="29" style="v" />Siapharan nynh hynhte a ho: ‘Hezekiah kha lingsakuh nan oh, pawccecize aning nynh nanning kha ka kuih kyate ae luesah kho lan khyh oh. <verse number="30" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening hynh oun luesah ccaccing cih; e khuapi hynh Assiria siapharan kuih kalan pya lan khyh, cite hopyate Hezekiah nynh nanning kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw ae doliasakuh nan oh sah,’ a ci. <verse number="31-32" style="v" />Hezekiah bya kha ngae nan oh; pawccecize Assiria siapharan nynh hynhte a ho: ‘Kae te ccawkunaw rae oh lah, ka kalan oun cceih oh; nanning nynh chi leite na hiin nawlan oh, nae ram te alokuhpaw ram, ccathae te misutui apounaw ram, sanlou te misu khokhu a umnaw ram, oliv chitui te khoitui a umnaw ram lang nanning kha cciakhae khylan kae thua mawlaezung, naemaw misu ku te naemaw thaeku raveih kya-e kha na ae cih oh zah, naemaw tuisung kya-e tui kha na neih cih oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh oun khum cih, cite hopyate ae la cciakhaesei oh ze, Hezekiah bya kha la ngae nan oh. <verse number="33" style="v" />Minphuin hae kya-e pachia hae nynh tuh-e ram kha Assiria siapharan kuih kyate a khum boi hae tou? <verse number="34" style="v" />Hamath khua te Arpad khua mih pachia hae tuh teimou a um hae? Sefarvaim khua, Hena khua te Ivvah khua kya-e mih pachia hae tuh teimou a um hae? Tuh-e pachia hae nynh Samaria ram kha ka kuih kyate a luesah hae tou? <verse number="35" style="v" />E ram hae kya-e mih pachia hae balyn nynh mih ram hae kha ka kuih kyate a khum boi paw pachia a um tou? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka kuih kyate Jerusalem kha pawtemou a khum kho cih?’ a ci,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae tuh bya kaw kheit san khungru leite yccae leite a um hae, pawccecize Hezekiah siapharan nynh, “La khungru nan oh,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan inn do-oihtu Hilkiah ccapaw Eliakim, ryaccinkhan Shebna te Asaf ccapaw ccawzeitu Joah nynh mih boeining seiikute Hezekiah kalan oun thua hae zah, Rabshakeh nynh a hopaw bya kha a hopya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekiah nynh Isaiah Tuanaw A Ngia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 37:1-7">Isa 37.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah Siapharan nynh tuh-e bya kha he a thae te, a boeining kha seii zah buriboei kha a zingku, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang a cceih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Siapharan inn do-oihtu Eliakim, ryaccinkhan Shebna te buriboei a zingkuh hae paw ranpibawi piccanhua hae kha Amoz ccapaw profeh Isaiah kalan a saw hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin nynh Isaiah kyakhe, “Hezekiah nynh hynhte a ho, Atunin tuh lungriathae nin, thuihei nin te thethya nin nynh thua; imua pui zaw zah a pui nawlan thawzung um khyh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahiinpaw Pachia kha sarya khylan Assiria siapharan nynh yn sawpaw a ryalahtu Rabshakeh bya balyn kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh la thae vae sah, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh a thaepaw bya kha detah vae sah; tukeiccuze a laehypaw ccungccaw hae hanlan saw la sang,” a cipya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Hezekiah Siapharan a ryalahtu hae nynh Isaiah kya he a thua hae te, <verse number="6" style="v" />Isaiah nynh minmin kha, “ ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Assiria siapharan a ryalahtu hae nynh ka thethya oun ho hae paw bya na thae keiccuze rih nan. <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning nynh laanbya kha thae zah amaw ram lang a ki nawlan, a thinlung kya ka sang cih; amaw ram kyakhe thaloi te ka chisah cih, a ci,’ cite nae bawipaw kha la hopah oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Sennakherib nynh Hurawnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 37:8-20">Isa 37.8-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rabshakeh tuh yn ki zah, Assiria siapharan nynh Libnah khua a tuk cciamangpaw kha a muih; pawccecize siapharan tuh Lakhish khua kyate a pou vae cipaw kha a thae vae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Ethiopia Siapharan Tirhakah tuh Assiria rhawkaw kha dou khylan yn thokuh vae cipaw kha Assiria siapharan nynh he a thae te, locceihtu hae kha Hezekiah kalan bua saw hae zah, <verse number="10" style="v" />“Judah Siapharan Hezekiah kha hynhte na la hopah cih oh: Jerusalem tuh Assiria siapharan kuih kalan pya thua lan khyh, cite ae kinpyakupaw bya khate na doliakupaw na Pachia kha lingsakuh nan. <verse number="11" style="v" />Assiria siapharan hae nynh ram hae balyn kha khaleih roh hae zah pawtemou a cyi hae cipaw kha phe na thae vae. Na lue cih zawtou? <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka minpaaw hae nynh a la ro hae paw Gozan, Haran, Rezef khua hae te Telassar khua a um hae paw Eden ccungccaw hae kha mih pachia hae nynh a khum hae zawtou? <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath siapharan, Arpad siapharan, Sefarvaim khuapi e siapharan, Hena siapharan te Ivvah siapharan kha teimou a um hae?” cite bya a taw.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hezekiah Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh tuh-e ccaw tuh locceihtu hae kuih kyate lawkuh zah a ria; oute Hezekiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang cceihthung zah, tuh-e ccaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang a daw. <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sawsang zah a hopaw tuh: “Pou vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, cherubim vawlan a haungpaw, Israel Pachia, nang tuh Pachia nynh na thua, laephi vaw e peenaw balyn kyaze nang rou nynh Pachia na thua; vaaw te lae kha na rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Exo 25.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na nakaring kha beih yn tuakuh lah thaetua; pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na mit kha dae lah beih muihtua; Sennakherib nynh ahiinpaw Pachia kha sarya khylan ccungccaw sawte a hosah hae paw bya kha thaetua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thanccingte, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Assiria siapharan hae nynh minphuin hae te mih ram hae balyn kha roh hae zah, <verse number="18" style="v" />mih pachia hae kha maee lungkhu lang a phungpya hae, tuh-e pachia hae tuh pachia thua khyh hae, ccungccaw kuih te raepaw thing te lung athua hae keiccuze ro athua vae hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia, kaening hynh Assiria siapharan kuih kyate oun khumtua cite na kalan saw ka sang, tuhteze nynh laephi vaw e peenaw balyn nynh, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang rou nynh Pachia na thua cipaw kha a nyh cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tetuh Amoz ccapaw Isaiah nynh Hezekiah kalan ccungccaw saw hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Assiria Siapharan Sennakherib te asekuh lante ka kalan saw na sang keiccuze, <verse number="21" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aning te asekuh lante bya a hopaw tuh hynhte nynh thua:</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Ccanung liaccady Zion nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha pawlang ae ria khyh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ae nuinse;</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem ccanung nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na nulang te a lu ae henua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Nang nynh hummou nuinsete</para>
  <para style="q2">na san na ruin?</para>
  <para style="q1">Na sianua zah lysakunaw mit te</para>
  <para style="q2">na dopaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hum cite mou na tua?</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw lakha</para>
  <para style="q2">na rawse!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na locceihtu hae kha mangte</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw kha na sarya zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka marangle patae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">mua ahangnaw kalan,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahang huapaw Lebanon mua dung hae</para>
  <para style="q2">kalan ka kaethung vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ahang huaccepaw a sidar ku hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy huaccepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a maeccaw ku hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nge hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ahang huaccenaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">thingku athaaw huaccenaw</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhpi kya phe ka thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuisung ka thae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang tui kha ka nia,</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip ram e vawkhu balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccukaw te ka rousah,” na ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />‘E hynh langmawlya te</para>
  <para style="q2">ka la paccynku vae cipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na thae boi khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Lungrua te koihlupaw khuapi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">aronahpaw apumkuhpaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">na rae nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">khawlya te ka la paccynpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">atu tuh ka ccingsah vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuin kya a um hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thawzya, siikuh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lung pong mangkhaekuh vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh loo lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q1">aku hae hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nebaleihpaw lonua hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">innccukaly umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ale kheccung mawze baleih anaanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">aku hawte thuasah athua hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“ ‘Thuasalama na thokunaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">na haungnaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">na pounaw te na teenaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">te ka tungvaw na thinrianaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ka ny.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka tungvaw na thinria zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na lysakunaw kha ka naw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thae vae keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q2">na napaw kae tho cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na mung kha rangtei kae teisah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ccianaw laanpi mawkhate</para>
  <para style="q1">kae kisah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“ ‘Nang na hanlan muihsahnaw tuh hynhcite athua cih: Atu kum tuh amaw le lan alethungpaw ccathae kha ae oh, khuavae kya mah tuhcite alethungpaw kha ae oh; hankum kya tuh ccathae kha ccoukuh oh lah, rue oh, misu khokhu kya lin oh lah, misu thae kha ae oh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahiinhypaw Judah phin hae tuh akawlan mih tharui a sawthui cih zah, avawlan khe mih thae athae cih; <verse number="31" style="v" />pawccecize a laehy hae paw tuh Jerusalem kyate oun pou cih hae zah, ahiin hae paw phu tuh Zion Mua kyate oun pou cih hae. E hynh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh lungthote a cyih cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“ ‘Tukeiccuze Assiria siapharan te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Aning nynh e khua lungkhu lang tee lan khyh, khuapi lungkhu kya the ccangkheit san kaw lan khyh, khawriaphua ccyngkute khuapi malang langkuh lan khyh, khuapi kha rawsete po voilu lan laephi adohpaw kha pumnua lan khyh hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Yn ccianaw laanpi mawkhate a kithui cih; aning nynh e khuapi lungkhu lang tee lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="34" style="v" />Kamaw hanlan te ka ryalahtu David hanlan, e khua hynh khum khylan ka thungkhaw cih,’ a ci,” cite a hopya.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Sennakherib Shung zah A Chih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuh-e khuazi ccaccei khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh yn langkuh zah, Assiria rhawkaw ryahmin kya-e milu cciing kheit sung tarya thong pangaw kha a chia hae; awkhua takaw khua he yn dae tuh, michi rhua lang pong a tang hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Tetuh Assiria Siapharan Sennakherib tuh toikuh zah, inn lang ki zah Nineveh khua kya a um vae. <verse number="37" style="v" />A pachia Nisrok inn kya a beik cciamang lyakhe a ccapaw hae Adrammelek te Sharezer nynh amaw kha thaloi te phe a chia hae, minmin tuh Ararat ram lungkhu lang po a ccue hae. A ccapaw Esar-haddon nynh a paaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang vae.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekiah Ccinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(Isa 38.1-8, 21-22; <ref loc="2CH 32:24-26">2Sh 32.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh lyatuin Hezekiah tuh ccih zah vyavya a chih. Amoz ccapaw profeh Isaiah nynh a kalan cceih zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Na inn ryalaw kha hoyte synriasya, pawccecize na chih vae cih; na dan vae lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tetuh Hezekiah nynh pan kalan khe a mae kha hawi zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan saw a sang: <verse number="3" style="v" />“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, ka thinlung balyn te lungzite na malang ka hiin zah, na muihnaw kya ahoypaw uccaw ka cyipaw kha atu beih liathuitua, namaw kha kae ngiaku,” ci zah, thawte a rah. <verse number="4" style="v" />Isaiah tuh siapharan inn angaelung e voidu kyate a pou mawkhe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh a kalan yn thua zah: <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ki lah, ka ccungccaw hae bawipaw Hezekiah kha la hopah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na minpaaw David Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Na sawsangnaw kha ka thae zah, na mitphi kha ka muih vae; kae dansah ccaccing cih; nin thumnaw nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang na cceihthung cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Na hiinnaw kha kum haw lae pangaw kae piapah chih cih. Nang te hynh-e khua hynh Assiria siapharan kuih kyate kae luesah cih oh; kamaw liate thuasah, ka ryalahtu David liate thuasah e khua hynh ka thungkhaw cih,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te Isaiah nynh, “Thaeku thae ange nge kheit kha oun lah oh. Te cciakhae hae sah lah, siapharan a danthui nawlan a vaemaw kha la bongpah hae sah,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh Isaiah kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn dansah cih zah, nin thumnaw nin kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang ka cceihthung cih cinawpaw muihsahnaw tuh pawmou athua cih?” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Isaiah nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya ae kinpyakupaw kha a cyih cih cinawpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate na kalan yn thuapaw muihsahnaw tuh hynh-e hynh nynh thua: mynlyh tuh malang tou kaw haw a cceih cih, nulang tou kaw haw a ki cih?” cite a khia. <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh, “Mynlyh hanlan malang kaw haw saehua tuh huatawpaw nynh thua; mynlyh tuh nulang kaw haw ki vae sah,” cite a khung. <verse number="11" style="v" />Profeh Isaiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan he a sia tuh, Ahaz kya-e khuanin tounawpaw vawlan phe anuekuh vae paw mynlyh kha nulang kaw haw a kisah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Babilon Ram kyate Locceihtu hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">Isa 39.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Baladan ccapaw, Babilon Siapharan Merodak Baladan nynh Hezekiah tuh ccih zah a dan vae cipaw a thae keiccuze ccaw te lasung phusahpyate locceihtu hae kha Hezekiah kalan a saw hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh minmin kha hoyte do-oih hae zah, a sisuainn, ngun, sui, amynkhuhpaw, aphutepaw chitui, a zunghe inn abalyn, a uccaw ccynawpaw inn kya a umpaw balyn kha a dosah hae. A inn kya te a uknaw ram kya a umpaw balyn kha Hezekiah nynh a dosah lei hae paw ccangkheit san um khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh profeh Isaiah tuh Hezekiah Siapharan kalan yn thua zah, “E ccungccaw hae nynh pawtemou a ho hae? Paw kyate mou na kalan oun thua hae?” a cipya. Hezekiah nynh, “Myarya asawnaw Babilon ram kyate nynh ka kalan oun thua hae,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Isaiah nynh, “Na inn kya pawmou a muih hae?” a cipya. Hezekiah nynh, “Ka inn umpaw miakaw pong a muih hae; ka uccaw ccynawpaw inn kyaze minmin ka dosah lei hae paw ccangkheit san um khyh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh Isaiah nynh Hezekiah kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngaetua: <verse number="17" style="v" />Na inn kya a umpaw balyn te na minpaaw hae nynh atunin cia a ccakhung hae paw balyn kha Babilon lang cciakhaenaw ccyh yn thua cih; pawpaw sanmah cciataw thua lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">2Si 24.13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Sh 36.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Na saahku hae paw na ccapaw hae abang tuh ccaring a cciakhae cih hae zah, Babilon siapharan inn kya ryalaw khylan mih tin a reih cih hae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-15">2Si 24.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-7">Dan 1.1-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh Hezekiah nynh Isaiah kha, “Na hopaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ahoy,” a cipya. Pawccecize aning nynh, “Ka she lungkhu daenaw te khynnaw a um cih,” cite a tua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hezekiah Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 32:32-33">2Sh 32.32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Hezekiah a cyisahnaw te a thungnaw balyn kha thuasah, pawtemou tuili te tuizypi kha rae zah khua lungkhu lang tui a thuasah cipaw kha thuasah Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Hezekiah tuh a minpaaw hae ryte a ih hae; te a ccapaw Manasseh nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Manasseh nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 33:1-20">2Sh 33.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh tuh kum haw lae ning acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kyate sung pangaw kum pangaw a uk. A nung min tuh Hefzibah acikuh. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae malang te a dee hae paw minphuin hae nynh a cyi hae paw anungsikuhpaw cyisahnaw kha zuite, aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:4">Jer 15.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />A paaw Hezekiah nynh a la ropaw ahangpaw hmin hae kha a raethui; Israel siapharan Ahab nynh a cyi hawte Baal elang silawhang hae kha raepah zah Asherah kha mah a rae, vaawlui kya umpaw uccaw hae balyn kha beik zah rya a lawpya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Jerusalem khua kya ka min kha ka nung cih,” cite a la ci nuathepaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyakhe silawhang hae kha a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:13">2Sa 7.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn voidu ccangning kyakhe vaawlui kya umpaw uccaw hae balyn hanlan silawhang hae kha a rae. <verse number="6" style="v" />A ccapaw kha silaw nawlan maee te a u; beidinhonaw te kuihdokunaw kha mang zah, chihiinleihthya hae paw te mitleihthya hae paw kha mah a mang hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw patae kha rae zah a thin a riasah. <verse number="7-8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David te a ccapaw Solomon kyakhe, “E inn kya thuasah, Israel phin hae balyn kyate ka popaw Jerusalem khua kya thuasah ka min kha zungzae ka tynsah cih; kaw ka pya hae paw balyn thyhte thuasah, ka ryalahtu Moses nynh kaw a pya hae paw kawbya balyn thyhte thuasah minmin nynh raeringkute a cyi hae zetuh, mih minpaaw hae ka pya hae paw ram kyate mih ccu kha ccanglang ka cciasah sei vae lan khyh,” cite a hopyanaw hae inn lungkhu khe amaw nynh karouhte azuh soi zah a raepaw Asherah zohtuh kha a nung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.7-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:3-5">1Si 9.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:12-18">2Sh 7.12-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh a bya ngae khyh hae; Israel ccungccaw hae malang te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ro hae paw minphuin hae nynh a la cyi hae paw laeze hoyleinaw kha houh rae khylan Manasseh nynh a cciakhaesei hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu profeh hae kyate ho zah, <verse number="11" style="v" />“Judah siapharan Manasseh nynh hynh-e anungsikuhpaw hae hynh cyih zah, aning mawze a la um hae paw Amor hae nynh a cyi hae paw balyn laeze hoyleinaw kha houh rae zah, a zohtuh hae khate Judah hae kha mah seinaw a raesah hae; <verse number="12" style="v" />tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho, a thaepaw miakaw a nakaring kya ringtering lan accae cih paw hoyleinaw kha Jerusalem te Judah tungvaw kya ka thuasah cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem luki te Samaria tounawpaw rui te Ahab ciihan tounawpaw rui kha ka raw cih; lukhakheit nynh pake kha huh zah a bunglung hawte Jerusalem kha ka bunglung cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />A laehypaw ka rho ccungccaw hae kha ka vua cih hae zah mih rhaw hae kuih kalan ka pya cih hae; minmin tuh mih rhaw hae balyn hanlan teipaw saw te luadepaw uccaw lang a tang cih hae, <verse number="15" style="v" />pawccecize Izip ram kyate mih minpaaw hae a pou nin hae te atunin cia ka muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha rae hae zah ka thin yn riasah hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Manasseh nynh Judah hae kha seinaw a raesah hae keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya seinaw a rae hae, tuh-e amaw a seinaw apiaze, seinaw a hoi lei hae paw chiise patae kha luasah zah, Jerusalem khua voikheit langte voikheit lang adianaw cia tuh-e chiise te a biasah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Manasseh nynh rya a lawpaw, a cyipaw balyn te seinaw a la raepaw kha Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Manasseh tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, Uzza khokhu lungkhu, amaw khokhu kyakhe a uu hae. A ccapaw Amon nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Amon nynh Judah Ram A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 33:21-25">2Sh 33.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amon tuh kum kuin lae ning acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum ning a uk. A nung min tuh Meshullemeth cikuh zah Jotbah khuapaw Haruz ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />A paaw Manasseh nynh a la rae hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae. <verse number="21" style="v" />A paaw nynh a zuipaw laanpi balyn kha a zui, a paaw nynh rya a la lawpya hae paw zohtuh hae kha ryalawpah hae zah a beik hae; <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, a minpaaw hae Pachia kha vua zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> laanpi kha zui khyh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Amon tuh amaw a ryalahtu hae nynh phee hae zah a inn kya a chia hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama ramccungccaw hae balyn nynh Siapharan Amon a pheetu hae kha theih hae zah, a ccapaw Josiah kha amaw ccelang siapharan lang a khang hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Amon nynh rya a lawpaw kha Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Amon kha Uzza khokhu umpaw amaw shawku kya a uu hae; a ccapaw Josiah nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Josiah nynh Judah Ram A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 34:1-2">2Sh 34.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah tuh kum tarya acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah Jerusalem kyate sung thum kum kheit a uk. A nung min tuh Jedidah cikuh zah Bozkath khuapaw Adaiah ccanung nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:6">Jer 3.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha cyih zah a minpaaw David laanpi balyn kha a zui, voilang ranglang maekuh khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hilkiah nynh Kawbya Ccauh A Ccung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 34:8-28">2Sh 34.8-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siapharan Josiah nynh ram a uknaw kum haw lae taryanaw kum khe, Meshullam ccapaw Azaliah a ccapaw, ryaccinkhan rya a lahpaw Shafan kha siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang saw zah, <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ranpibawi lupi Hilkiah kalan la cceihthung lah, thuakaw ngawtu hae nynh ccungccaw hae kya-e ahlu a khoi hae paw phua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang a thuakhae hae paw balyn kha aning nynh ria sah; <verse number="5" style="v" />tuh-e phua tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn a do-oihpaw ryalahtu hae kuih kalan pya hae sah lah, minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn a raethui hae paw ryalahtu hae, <verse number="6" style="v" />lehccama hae, inn saktu hae te pazan thya hae paw kha pya hae sah; te inn raethuinaw lanpaw thing a awkuh vae paw te lung adeihkuh vae paw re nawlan mang hae sah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Mih kuih kya phua pya athua hae paw ccungccaw hae nynh hmerarih lan rya a law hae keiccuze minmin kha phua ccazing khiathui thua vae lan khyh hae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:15">2Si 12.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ranpibawi lupi Hilkiah nynh ryaccinkhan Shafan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya kawbya ccauh kha ka muih vae,” a cipya. Hilkiah nynh ccauh kha pya zah, aning nynh a ria. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te ryaccinkhan Shafan nynh siapharan kalan cceih zah, “Na ryalahtu hae nynh inn lungkhu umpaw phua kha marya lah hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn a do-oihpaw ryalahtu hae kuih kya a pya vae hae,” cite a hopya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ryaccinkhan Shafan nynh siapharan kha, “Ranpibawi Hilkiah nynh ccauh yn pya vae,” a cipya. Shafan nynh siapharan kha accae lante a riapya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siapharan nynh kawbya ccauh lungkhu e bya hae kha he a thae tuh, a boeining kha a seii. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh ranpibawi Hilkiah, Shafan ccapaw Ahikam, Mikaiah ccapaw Akhbor, ryaccinkhan Shafan te siapharan ryalahtu Asaiah kha kawpya hae zah, <verse number="13" style="v" />“La cceih oh lah, muih athuapaw hynh-e ccauh lungkhu e bya hae te asekuh lante kamaw hanlan, ccungccaw hae hanlan te Judah hae balyn hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha la khiatua oh; aening elang hynh-e ccauh kya azeikuhpaw bya hae balyn thyhte, ah minpaaw hae nynh la zui khyh hae zah la cyi khyh hae keiccuze aening tungvaw maee lang ruapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh myaryamaw ale,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ranpibawi Hilkiah, Ahikam, Akhbor, Shafan te Asaiah tuh boeining nungnaw a do-oihtu Harhas ccapaw Tikvah a ccapaw Shallum zu profehnung Huldah kalan a cceih hae; tuh-e profehnung tuh Jerusalem khua Zakueh Ccangningnaw kya um zah, tuin kyakhe amaw kha tuanaw a ngia hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Ka kalan nanning ae saw oh paw ccungccapaw kha la hopah oh, <verse number="16" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, Judah siapharan nynh a riapaw ccauh lungkhu e bya hae balyn thyhte, e hmin te a lungkhu um hae paw balyn tungvaw kya ronaw kha ka thuasah ccaccing cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Kae kha yn vua hae zah mih kuih te a raeku hae paw balyn khate ka thinriasah khylan ccangpaw pachia hae kalan khe silawnaw a rae vae hae, tukeiccuze hynh-e hmin elang ka thinrianaw tuh maee lang rua zah chih kho vae lan khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha byakhia khylan nanning ae sawtu oh paw Judah siapharan kha tuh hynhte na la hopah cih oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Na thaepaw bya konglang te, <verse number="19" style="v" />e hmin te e kya um hae paw tuh arohpaw lang te thyalawnaw a teing hae paw lang a tang cih hae cite minmin rawsenaw bya ka hopaw kha he na thae te, na thinlung tuh ngaesikuh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang zakaw na sangsaku keiccu thuasah, na boeining na seii zah ka malang na raw keiccu thuasah kae nynh mah na bya kha kae thaepya vae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang tuh na minpaaw hae kya kae sueluabua cih zah daebabi lan na shaw lungkhu sueluabua na thua cih; e hmin kya ka thuasah cih paw ronaw balyn kha na mit nynh muih lan khyh, a ci cite la hopah oh,” a cipya hae. Tuh-e bya tuh minmin nynh siapharan kalan a kikhae hae.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Josiah nynh Raethuinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(2Sh 34.3-7, 29-33)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh Judah te Jerusalem piccan hae balyn kha amaw kalan a kosah hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Siapharan tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang cceihthung zah amaw ryte Judah ccungccaw hae balyn, Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae balyn, ranpibawi hae, profeh hae, ccungccaw adih ale hae balyn a cceihbua hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya a muih hae paw byakinnaw ccauh kya-e bya balyn kha a thaenaw hae khe a ria. <verse number="3" style="v" />Siapharan tuh tungpi pe thadyn zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha zui khylan, a kawbya hae, a phunglang hae te a phungbya hae kha a thinlung balyn te, a hiinnaw balyn te zui khylan te e ccauh lungkhu azeikuhpaw hynh-e byakinnaw bya hae hynh cyi khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe byakinkunaw a rae. Ccungccaw hae balyn nynh mah tuh-e byakinnaw tuh a raebua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ranpibawi lupi Hilkiah, ccangningnaw ranpibawi hae, thuakaw ngawtu hae kha Baal pachia, Asherah te vaawlui umpaw uccaw hae balyn hanlan a raepya hae paw angphe balyn kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kyate poukhae lan siapharan nynh kaw a pya hae; tuh-e hae tuh Jerusalem khua atolang, Kidron loo kyakhe maee te u hae zah mih buhhaw kha Bethel lang a cciakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.4-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:3">2Si 21.3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:3">2Sh 33.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah ram e khua hae te Jerusalem pepan umpaw ahangpaw hmin hae kya mynkhuhpaw a utu lang Judah siapharan hae nynh a la nung hae paw zohtuh ranpibawi hae kha mih ryalaw kyate a phua hae; Baal kalan, khuanin kalan, sawpaw kalan, aphuphute um hae paw awsi hae te vaawlui kya umpaw uccaw hae balyn kalan silawnaw a raetu kha mah mih ryalaw kyate a phua hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Asherah zohtuh kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyate poukhae zah Jerusalem khua atolang, Kidron Vaw kalan a cciakhae; Kidron Vaw khe maee te u zah palae tui lan a bua koute akhui kha huatawpaw ccungccaw hae shawku vawlan khe a hei. <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya umpaw beiknaw lante a ohhuakuhpaw pise hae inn hae kha a ro, tuh-e inn hae kyakhe nopi hae nynh Asherah hanlan boei a kuapya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah ram e khua hae kyate ranpibawi hae balyn kha poukhae hae zah, ranpibawi hae nynh si a lawnaw hae ahangpaw hmin hae kha, Geba khua kyate Beersheba khua kyacia a thusah hae; Jerusalem khua uktu bawi Joshua koikua teenaw, khua koikua voilang um hae paw koikua kya-e ahangpaw hmin hae kha a tingbung hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahangpaw hmin hae kya-e ranpibawi hae tuh Jerusalem umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang kalan cceihthung bua khyh hae, thuasalama ransi phingkuh leipaw sanlou kha tuh mih uno hae kya a aebua hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah Molek pachia kalan a ccapaw khyhze a ccanung khate maee-ute silawnaw a rae khyh nawlan, Ben-hinnom accya kya umpaw Tofeth kha anungsikuhpaw lang a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18.21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:31">Jer 7.31</ref>, <ref loc="JER 19:1-6">19.1-6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 32:35">32.35</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn teenaw, voidu thuakaw kin umpaw tinriapaw Nathan-melek a khaan pe a umpaw, Judah siapharan hae nynh khuanin hanlan a pya hae paw marang hae kha mah ccaring a nue; te khuanin a marangle hae kha maee te a soi. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahaz kya-e palung khaan innccuvaw kya umpaw silawhang hae, Judah siapharan hae nynh la rae hae paw kha thuasah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn voidu ccangning kya Manasseh nynh a la raepaw silawhang hae kha thuasah siapharan nynh tingbung zah zoihtatyh lan a koi, te tuh-e athupaw tuh Kidron Vaw lungkhu langkhe a vua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:5">2Si 21.5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:5">2Sh 33.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem nithua lang, Ronaw Mua alia lang umpaw ahangpaw hmin hae kha siapharan nynh anungsikuhpaw lang a rae hae, tuh-e ahangpaw hmin hae tuh Israel hae siapharan Solomon nynh Sidon hae pachia anungsikuhpaw Ashtoreth, Moab hae pachia anungsikuhpaw Khemoh te Ammon hae pachia anungsikuhpaw Milkom hanlan a la raepaw nynh thua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:7">1Si 11.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Zohtuh hae kha zoihtatyh lan koi hae zah Asherim kha thoh pae lan a bae hae, tuh-e hmin hae kyakhe ccungccaw ru kha phe a biasah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Israel hae kha seinaw a raesah hae paw Jeroboam, Nebat ccapaw nynh Bethel khua kya a raepaw ahangpaw hmin te silawhang kha a tingbung; ahangpaw hmin kha tingbung zah palae tui lan maee te a soi; Asherah kha mah maee te a soi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:33">1Si 12.33</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Josiah nynh maeleihkuh zah mua vawlan umpaw shawku hae kha a muih; te ccungccaw saw hae zah shaw lungkhu e ccungccaw ru kha lah hae zah silawhang vawlan khe maee te soi hae zah anungsikuhpaw lang a rae hae, tuh-e tuh poi tua lyaze Jeroboam nynh silawhang pe a thadyn lyakhe Pachia ccungccapaw nynh a la hopaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte nynh athua; aning nynh maeleihkuh zah tuh-e konglang a la hodaepaw Pachia ccungccapaw shawku kha a muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:2">1Si 13.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Josiah nynh, “Khuh-e ka muihpaw liathuinaw lungpum khuh pawmou athua?” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:30-32">1Si 13.30-32</ref></char></note>Khua kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh, “Bethel khua kya silawhang tungvaw na cyipaw miakaw kha a la hodaetupaw, Judah ram kyate yn thuapaw Pachia ccungccapaw shawku nynh thua,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Amaw tuh um sah; humhung nynh mah a ru kha nue nan sah,” a ci. Tukeiccuze a ru tuh Samaria kyate yn thuapaw profehpaw ru ryte tuhcihmawte a umsah hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, Israel siapharan hae nynh rae hae zah Samaria ram e khua hae kya a umpaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thin a riasahpaw ahangpaw hmin hae kya-e hmin thyaapaw hae balyn kha Josiah nynh a nue hae; Bethel khua kya a la cyi hawte khah-e hae kha mah a cyi hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahangpaw hmin hae kya-e ranpibawi hae, tuin kya um hae paw balyn kha silawhang hae vawlan khe theih hae zah, mih ru kha tuh-e silawhang hae vawlan khe maee te a soi. Tukoute Jerusalem lang a ki.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kawtaw Poi Tuanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 35:1-19">2Sh 35.1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Siapharan nynh ccungccaw balyn kha, “E byakinnaw ccauh kya azeiku hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kalan kawtaw poi kha tua oh,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel hae a uktu byapiatu hae she lyate thuasah, Israel siapharan hae te Judah siapharan hae she lya balyn te thuasah tuhcihawpaw kawtaw poi tuh la tua boi vae khyh hae; <verse number="23" style="v" />thuasalama Siapharan Josiah nynh ram a uknaw kum haw lae taryanaw kum khe, e kawtaw poi hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan Jerusalem kya a tua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuhpiaze ranpibawi Hilkiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu a muihpaw ccauh kya azeikuhpaw kawbya hae kha a tynsah nawlan, Josiah nynh chihiinleihthya hae paw, mitleihthya hae paw, tera zohtuh hae, zohtuh hae kha thuasah, Judah ram te Jerusalem kya muih athuapaw anungsikuhpaw balyn kha thuasah marya a vua hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Josiah mawze Josiah hawte a thinlung balyn te, a hiinnaw balyn te, a thawzung balyn te, Moses kawbya balyn thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a maekuhpaw siapharan um boi khyh; amaw koute mah amaw alopaw siapharan langkuh vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama Manasseh nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinria nawlan a la cyipaw balyn keiccuze Judah tungvaw a thinrianaw tuh maee lang rua zah, myarya lepaw a thinrianaw kyate a lungdae loh khyh. <verse number="27" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Israel kha ka dee hawte, Judah kha mah ka muihnaw kyate ka dee cih; ka la popaw hynh-e khuapi Jerusalem thuasah, ‘E kya ka min a um cih,’ cite ka la cipaw inn thuasah ka vua cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Rhawtuknaw kya Josiah A Chih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 35:20-36:1">2Sh 35.20—36.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Josiah nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn kha Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Josiah ccyh lyakhe Izip siapharan Faro Neko nynh Assiria siapharan kalan Zufrates vaw lang a cceihthung. Siapharan Josiah tuh amaw te tungku khylan a cceih; Faro Neko tuh Josiah ryte Megiddo kya he a tungkuh hae tuh, Josiah kha a chia. <verse number="30" style="v" />A ryalahtu hae nynh a rhua tuh Megiddo kyate marangle te phu hae zah Jerusalem lang cciakhae hae zah amaw shawku kya a uu hae. Ramccungccaw hae nynh Josiah ccapaw Jehoahaz kha kokute chitui thuh hae zah a paaw ccelang siapharan lang a khang hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoahaz nynh Judah Ram Uknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:2-4">2Sh 36.2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehoahaz tuh kum kuin lae thum acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah Jerusalem kyate sawpaw sah thum a uk. A nung min tuh Hamutal cikuh zah Libnah khuapaw Jeremiah ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="32" style="v" />A minpaaw hae nynh a la rae hae hawte, aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Jerusalem khua kya a uk khyh nawlan, Faro Neko nynh Hamath ram Riblah khua khe thong sah zah, Judah ram kha ngunto lang ngun talent za kheit te sui talent ccangkheit kha a ngia. <verse number="34" style="v" />Faro Neko nynh Josiah ccapaw Eliakim kha a paaw ccelang siapharan lang khang zah a min kha Jehoiakim cite a paleih. Thuasalama aning nynh Jehoahaz kha Izip ram lang cciakhae zah tuin ram kya a chih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:11-12">Jer 22.11-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v" />Jehoiakim nynh Faro kha sui te ngun a pya, thuasalama Faro nynh a ngiapaw phua kha ccingsah khylan a ram kha ngunto a khoi. Faro Neko pya lanpaw sui te ngun tuh a ramccungccaw hae kha khyapyapaw thyhte ccarou a ngiade hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoiakim nynh Judah Ram A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:5-8">2Sh 36.5-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiakim tuh kum kuin lae pangaw acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum haw lae kheit a uk. A nung min tuh Zebidah cikuh zah Rumah khuapaw Pedaiah ccanung nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:18-19">Jer 22.18-19</ref>, <ref loc="JER 26:1-6">26.1-6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 35:1-19">35.1-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v" />A minpaaw hae balyn nynh a la rae hae hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Rhaw hae nynh Judah Taenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoiakim she lyakhe Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar tuh yn cceihthung zah, Jehoiakim tuh kum thum lungkhu a ryalahtu lang a tang; tukoute rawse zah a dou.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:1-38">Jer 25.1-38</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-2">Dan 1.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu profeh hae kyate a la hopaw bya thyhte, Judah ram kha ro khylan Babilon hae, Siria hae, Moab hae te Ammon hae kha Judah kalan a sawnua hae. <verse number="3-4" style="v" />Manasseh nynh a la seipaw a seinaw balyn keiccu te seinaw a hoi lei hae paw chiise a la luasahpaw seinaw keiccuze a ccungccaw hae kha a muihnaw kyate dee khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawpyanaw te hynh-e uccaw hynh Judah tungvaw yn thua; pawccecize Jerusalem khua kha seinaw a hoi leipaw chiise khate biasah zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a seinaw kha ngaethya ry khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jehoiakim nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Judah Siapharan hae Sherianaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhcite Jehoiakim tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, a ccapaw Jehoiakim nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="7" style="v" />Izip siapharan tuh a ram kyate pou vae khyh, pawccecize Izip Vaw kyate Zufrates Vawpi kyacia Izip siapharan kya-e ram balyn kha Babilon siapharan nynh a law vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoiakhin Kyngnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:9-10">2Sh 36.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiakhin tuh kum haw lae tarya acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kyate sawpaw sah thum a uk. A nung min tuh Nehushta cikuh zah Jerusalem khuapaw Elnathan ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />A paaw nynh a la rae hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar a ryalahtu hae nynh Jerusalem kha oun ccianua thung hae zah a koihlu hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />A ryalahtu hae nynh khua a koihlu lya hae khe, Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar tuh Jerusalem khua lang a thua; <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah siapharan Jehoiakhin nynh amaw, a nung, a ryalahtu hae, a kuihkaw e bawi hae te a siapharan inn e bawi hae ryte Babilon siapharan kalan a apku. Babilon siapharan nynh ram a uknaw kum taryanaw kum khe Jehoiakhin kha thong a saw.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:24-30">Jer 22.24-30</ref>, <ref loc="JER 24:1-10">24.1-10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 29:1-2">29.1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Lawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya-e sisua balyn te siapharan inn kya-e sisua balyn kha Nebukhadnezzar nynh Babilon lang a phu; Israel siapharan Solomon nynh a raepaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya umpaw sui angphe hae balyn kha zoihtatyh lan a koi, e balyn hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a la hoty vae hawte nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae balyn, bawi hae balyn, a rawthung hae paw balyn, kyngpaw ccungccaw abalyn thong haw, kuihhae hoy hae paw balyn te sosuhthya hae paw balyn kha marya a cciakhae hae; ram lungkhu e a ryachi huaccepaw ccungccaw hae laelan, lu kheit sanmah laehy khyh hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehoiakhin kha Babilon lang a cciakhae; siapharan a nung, siapharan zu hae, a kuihkaw e bawi hae te ram lungkhu e ccungkiahua hae paw kha kyngte Jerusalem kyate Babilon lang a cciakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:12">Eze 17.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Arawthungpaw ccungccaw thong sari, kuihhae hoy hae paw te sosuhthya hae paw thong kheit, a thawsae zah rhaw a tuk kho cih hae paw kha mih balynte Babilon siapharan nynh kyng hae zah Babilon lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Babilon siapharan nynh Jehoiakhin a paaw neitawpaw Mattaniah kha Jehoiakhin ccelang siapharan lang khang zah, a min kha Zedekiah cite a paleih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:1">Jer 37.1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:13">Eze 17.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Zedekiah nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:11-12">2Sh 36.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:1-3a">Jer 52.1-3a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zedekiah tuh kum kuin lae kheit acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kya kum haw lae kheit a uk. A nung min tuh Hamutal cikuh zah Libnah khuapaw Jeremiah ccanung nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:1-22">Jer 27.1-22</ref>, <ref loc="JER 28:1-17">28.1-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Jehoiakim nynh a la rae hawte, Zedekiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jerusalem te Judah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha myaryamaw a thinriasah hae zah, aning nynh minmin kha a muihnaw kyate ccaring a dee hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:15">Eze 17.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Judah Shungnaw te Kyngnaw</para>
  <para style="p">Zedekiah nynh Babilon siapharan kha a dou.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Ronaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:13-21">2Sh 36.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:3b-11">Jer 52.3b-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah nynh ram a uknaw kum takuanaw, sawpaw sah hawnaw, nin haw nin khe Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar tuh a rhawkaw hae balyn ryte Jerusalem kha oun ccianua hae zah a koihlu hae; khuapi po voilu lan laekarung kha a thaenuaku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:1-10">Jer 21.1-10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 34:1-5">34.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:2">Eze 24.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekiah Siapharan nynh ram a uknaw kum haw lae kheitnaw cia khuapi kha a koihlu hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e kum, sawpaw sah palinaw, nin takua nin khe khuapi kya ccakan myarya ccih zah, ram kya-e ccungccaw hae hanlan looh um vae khyh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh Babilon hae nynh khualungrua kha uasakuh hae zah khuapi po voilu lan a um hae zemah, Judah rhawkaw hae balyn tuh khuazi khe ccue hae zah, siapharan khokhu pe umpaw khualungrua ccangning laku e koikua kyate khuapi atolang poute Arabah langkhe a cceih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:21">Eze 33.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama Babilon rhawkaw hae nynh siapharan Zedekiah kha deehui hae zah, Jeriko bialae khe a phya hae; a rhawkaw hae balyn nynh amaw kha ccuetaw hae zah pong phiakuh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan kha kyng hae zah, Hamath ram Riblah khua umpaw Babilon siapharan kalan a thuakhae hae, te aning nynh Zedekiah kha bya a pia. <verse number="7" style="v" />Zedekiah ccapaw hae kha mih paaw muihnaw khe a chia hae, te Zedekiah mit kha a khoi hae, sivawrui te khii hae zah Babilon lang a cciakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:13">Eze 12.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Ronaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JER 52:12-23">Jer 52.12-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar nynh Babilon siapharan lang a tangnaw kum haw lae takuanaw kum, sawpaw sah pangawnaw, nin sari nin khe Babilon siapharan a ryalahtu, a pyn rhawviapahtu hae rhawbawipaw Nebuzaradan tuh Jerusalem lang a cceih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn, siapharan inn te Jerusalem e inn balyn kha maee te a soi; inn lepaw miakaw kha maee te khaleih a soi. <verse number="10" style="v" />Rhawviatu rhawkaw hae bawipaw ryte a umkheih hae paw Babilon rhawkaw hae balyn nynh Jerusalem akoihlupaw khualungrua balyn kha pong a tingsah hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Rhawviatu hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh khuapi kya a laehy hae paw, Babilon siapharan kalan a ccue hae paw te a laehy hae paw balyn kha kyng hae zah a cciakhae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama rhawviatu hae rhawbawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh ram lungkhu e mih ryachiccih huacce hae paw abang kha misu khokhu kya ryalahtu lang te loophotu lang a cciataw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya umpaw sohin tung hae, tui nungnawpaw rahung te a thadynnawpaw atung hae kha Babilon hae nynh zoihtatyh lan khya hae zah, sohin balyn kha Babilon lang a cciakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:15-26">1Si 7.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:15-17">2Sh 3.15-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Ang hae, buhhawlua hae, tetakia hae, mynkhuhpaw unawpaw pake hae, beikinn ryalawnaw kya mangpaw sohin te raekuhpaw angphe balyn kha a cciakhae hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:45">1Si 7.45</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:16">2Sh 4.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />maee-e nungnawpaw pake hae te pakepi hae kha mah a law hae. Rhawviatu hae rhawbawipaw nynh sui te raekuhpaw kya-e sui te ngun te raekuhpaw kya-e ngun kha a cciakhae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn elang a raepaw tung tungning, tuikua kua kheit te a thadynnawpaw hae, e sohin angphe hae balyn tuh aripaw tou kho um lei lan ciate alung. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tung tungkheit ze dong haw lae tarya hang zah tung adung khe sohin te raekuhpaw tunglukhung a um; tuh-e tunglukhung tuh dong thum hang zah, adung tuh po voilu lan sohin te raekuhpaw sivaw te ccalee thae a um hae. Te tung tungningnaw tuh mah sohin te raekuhpaw sivaw ryte tuhcih maminte a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rhawviatu rhawkaw hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh ranpibawi lepaw Seraiah, lu ningnaw ranpibawi Zefaniah te beikinn thuakaw ngawtu lu thum kha a cciakhae hae; <verse number="19" style="v" />khuapi kyate rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawi lu kheit, khuapi kya muih athua hae paw siapharan kungsi kya-e lu pangaw, ramccungccaw hae a sueluatu rhawbawi athuapaw ryaccinkhan lu kheit, khuapi kya muih athua hae paw ramccungccaw sung taruh kha a cciakhae hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te rhawviatu hae rhawbawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh minmin kha Riblah khua umpaw Babilon siapharan kalan a thuakhae hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te Babilon siapharan nynh Hamath ram Riblah khua khe minmin kha bua hae zah a chia hae. Tuhcite Judah hae tuh kyng hae zah mih ram kyate ramccang lang a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Judah hae A Uktu Gedaliah</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JER 40:7-9">Jer 40.7-9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 41:1-3">41.1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh nungsya hae zah Judah ram kya a laehy hae paw kha a uktu lang Shafan ccapaw Ahikam a ccapaw Gedaliah kha a khang. <verse number="23" style="v" />Babilon siapharan nynh Gedaliah kha uktu lang a khang cipaw kong kha rhawkaw hae kya-e rhawbawi hae te mih ccungccaw hae nynh he a thae hae tuh, Mizpah khua umpaw Gedaliah kalan a cceih hae, tuh-e hae tuh Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael, Kareah ccapaw Hohanan, Netofah ccungccaw Tanhumeth ccapaw Seraiah te Maakah ccungccapaw ccapaw Jaazaniah nynh thua hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Gedaliah nynh minmin te mih ccungccaw hae kha byakinpakuh hae zah, “Babilon ccungccaw bawi hae keiccu rih nan oh; ram lungkhu um oh lah, Babilon siapharan rya kha lawpah oh, naemaw elang ahoy cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama sawpaw sah sarinaw khe Elishama ccapaw Nethaniah a ccapaw Ishmael, siapharan ciihan athuapaw nynh ccungccaw lu haw ryte oun cceih hae zah, Gedaliah te Mizpah khua kya amaw kya a umbua hae paw Judah hae te Babilon hae kha phe chih lan a bua hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tetuh ccungccaw balyn tuh adih ale, rhawkaw hae kya-e rhawbawi hae tuh Babilon hae raw a ri hae keiccuze thokuh hae zah Izip ram lang a cceih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:5-7">Jer 43.5-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoiakhin tungvaw Thawccinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JER 52:31-34">Jer 52.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah siapharan Jehoiakhin kha a kyngnaw hae te sung thum kum sarinaw, sawpaw sah haw lae ningnaw, nin kuin lae sari nin, Babilon siapharan Evil-merodak nynh ram a uk takaw kum khe, Judah siapharan Jehoiakhin kha thonginn kyate a luesah; <verse number="28" style="v" />aning kha hoyte byabeih zah, Babilon khua amaw kya a um hae paw ccangpaw siapharan hae mih haungnaw laeze ahang huapaw haungnaw kha a pya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jehoiakhin nynh thonginn lungkhu a lawkupaw boeining kha khahkuh zah, a hiin lungkhu balyn siapharan ccaboi kya nin takyhte looh a ae. <verse number="30" style="v" />A hiin lungkhu balyn, nin takyhte a ae lanpaw looh kha Babilon siapharan nynh a pya.</para>
</usx>